('835daf35-0660-5deb-8511-f0cae6649f97','7fa0a36c-a10c-5b98-bbc9-57a054a19301',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you use to fight with or attack someone with, such as a knife , bomb , or gun',null,null,'سلاح، سلاح (جنگی)؛ سلاح (سپاه)؛ سلاح (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['nuclear/atomic weapons The country is thought to be developing nuclear weapons.','conventional weapons (= not nuclear ) With conventional weapons, the destruction is not so drastic.','chemical/biological weapons (= weapons that use chemicals such as poisonous gases, or dangerous germs ) Troops may have been exposed to chemical weapons.','an offensive weapon (= one that can be used to attack someone illegally ) He was charged with carrying an offensive weapon.','a lethal/deadly weapon (= one that can kill ) A knife is a lethal weapon.','the murder weapon (= the weapon used to kill someone ) Police found a knife at the scene that is believed to be the murder weapon.','an automatic weapon (= an automatic gun ) He was shot 120 times with automatic weapons.','carry a weapon The man is believed to be carrying a weapon.','use a weapon They claim the government used chemical weapons against them.','fire a weapon (= shoot a gun or missile ) Police were told not to fire their weapons.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They all had sticks which they planned to use as weapons.","translation":"همه آنها چوب هایی داشتند که قصد داشتند از آنها به عنوان سلاح استفاده کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001729.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a8a2e796-397c-587c-b864-c80d3f9c4ecc','7fa0a36c-a10c-5b98-bbc9-57a054a19301',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an action , piece of information, piece of equipment etc that you can use to win or be successful in doing something',null,null,'یک اقدام، اطلاعات، تجهیزات و غیره که می توانید از آن برای برنده شدن یا موفقیت در انجام کاری استفاده کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['nuclear/atomic weapons The country is thought to be developing nuclear weapons.','conventional weapons (= not nuclear ) With conventional weapons, the destruction is not so drastic.','chemical/biological weapons (= weapons that use chemicals such as poisonous gases, or dangerous germs ) Troops may have been exposed to chemical weapons.','an offensive weapon (= one that can be used to attack someone illegally ) He was charged with carrying an offensive weapon.','a lethal/deadly weapon (= one that can kill ) A knife is a lethal weapon.','the murder weapon (= the weapon used to kill someone ) Police found a knife at the scene that is believed to be the murder weapon.','an automatic weapon (= an automatic gun ) He was shot 120 times with automatic weapons.','carry a weapon The man is believed to be carrying a weapon.','use a weapon They claim the government used chemical weapons against them.','fire a weapon (= shoot a gun or missile ) Police were told not to fire their weapons.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a new weapon in the fight against AIDS","translation":"سلاحی جدید در مبارزه با ایدز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000512388.mp3"},{"sentence":"Right now, she felt the need of every weapon in her armoury (= weapon that she had ) , including surprise.","translation":"در حال حاضر، او نیاز به هر سلاحی را در اسلحه خانه خود احساس می کرد (= سلاحی که داشت)، از جمله غافلگیری.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642637.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('69b3e257-903b-5b29-b292-4e4c8c5f7b8c','868f851b-8638-5669-9b17-a645e09f249a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','happening or done every week',null,null,'هفتگی، هر هفته (رخداد)؛ هفته‌نامه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a weekly current affairs programme","translation":"برنامه هفتگی امور جاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000513600.mp3"},{"sentence":"twice-weekly flights","translation":"پروازهای دو بار در هفته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642558.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5cb87d5d-4ffa-5fc5-8bbf-53e568411041','368000fc-b926-5e79-b7ba-bf46ca8357f7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a magazine that appears once a week',null,null,'مجله ای که هفته ای یک بار منتشر می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a popular news weekly","translation":"یک هفته نامه خبری محبوب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000513616.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ff29550b-dc2a-5dc6-90f6-dc220868767d','44d6dc61-ce15-58ca-a2a6-503acd77b4e3',1,'amount somebody/something weighs','مقداری که کسی/چیزی وزن می کند','spoken & written','how heavy something is when you measure it','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'وزن، سنگینی؛ وزن (بدن)؛ وزن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The average weight of a baby at birth is just over seven pounds.","translation":"میانگین وزن نوزاد در هنگام تولد کمی بیش از هفت پوند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000513998.mp3"},{"sentence":"fish that are over two kilos in weight","translation":"ماهی هایی که بیش از دو کیلو وزن دارند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590342.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fruit and vegetables are sold by weight.","translation":"میوه و سبزیجات بر حسب وزن به فروش می رسند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590345.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8d909d20-bd89-5dcb-b74a-e9f915dfe3ef','44d6dc61-ce15-58ca-a2a6-503acd77b4e3',2,'how fat','چقدر چاق','spoken & written','how heavy and fat someone is','[ uncountable ]','overweight , underweight','یک نفر چقدر سنگین و چاق است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['put on weight ( also gain weight formal ) He had put on weight since she last saw him.','lose/shed weight She lost a lot of weight when she was ill.','watch your weight (= try not to get fatter, by eating the correct foods ) He has to watch his weight because he has a heart condition.','get/keep your weight down (= become thinner or stay thin ) How can I keep my weight down?','get/keep the weight off (= become or stay thinner ) I changed my eating habits so I’d keep the weight off.','a weight problem (= a tendency to be too fat ) I’ve always had a weight problem.','weight gain The medication can cause rapid weight gain.','weight loss After the first month, weight loss slows down.','somebody’s ideal weight (= what someone should weigh, according to their height and body type ) She weighs about 10lbs more than her ideal weight.','somebody’s target weight (= the weight someone is trying to be ) I’ve reached my target weight.','excess weight (= the pounds that make you heavier than you should be ) You’ll feel better if you lose the excess weight.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You shouldn’t worry about your weight.","translation":"شما نباید نگران وزن خود باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942864.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('de4920f3-b160-5cd7-9cc5-f6c90a55098d','44d6dc61-ce15-58ca-a2a6-503acd77b4e3',3,'heaviness','سنگینی','spoken & written','the fact that something is heavy','[ uncountable ]',null,'این واقعیت که چیزی سنگین است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The weight of her boots made it hard for Sue to run.","translation":"وزن چکمه هایش دویدن را برای سو سخت کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000514028.mp3"},{"sentence":"I didn’t know if the bridge would support our weight .","translation":"نمی دانستم که آیا پل وزن ما را تحمل می کند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001590370.mp3"},{"sentence":"Karen staggered along under the weight of her backpack.","translation":"کارن زیر وزن کوله پشتی اش تلوتلو خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000514032.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('1cc6c053-8e06-50fa-b1d9-6add53cc78b2','44d6dc61-ce15-58ca-a2a6-503acd77b4e3',4,'heavy thing','چیز سنگین','spoken & written','something that is heavy','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که سنگین است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t lift heavy weights because of my bad back.","translation":"به دلیل کمرم بد نمی توانم وزنه های سنگین بلند کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000514038.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
