so possess the ability to do something formal ) She has the ability to make people feel relaxed.','show/demonstrate the ability to do something a chance for candidates to demonstrate their abilities','lack the ability to do something As a young man, he lacked the ability to say no.','a level of ability/ability level The children were of the same age and ability level.','a range of ability/ability range There is a wide range of ability within the class. Disruptive behaviour is more prominent in the lower ability range.','a test of ability/an ability test Examinations are not always a good test of ability. The class was given a verbal ability test.','an ability group (= a group that students are taught in, based on their level of ability ) Children are divided into different ability groups.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The test measures your mathematical ability.","translation":"این آزمون توانایی ریاضی شما را می سنجد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000002.mp3"},{"sentence":"mixed ability classes","translation":"کلاس های توانایی مختلط","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001732765.mp3"},{"sentence":"students of average ability","translation":"دانش آموزان با توانایی متوسط","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001732764.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are musicians of all abilities.","translation":"نوازندگان با هر توانایی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000003.mp3"},{"sentence":"He showed his abilities as a leader.","translation":"او توانایی های خود را به عنوان یک رهبر نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000004.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('acca53db-6958-5efc-bb19-50de33b03177','716c3b19-d875-5373-9a6c-ac399df71a95',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'to the best of your ability','توانایی، قابلیت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f342890b-6ff7-5d5d-9c85-7b97a686f913','0b1dafe0-866e-5cbf-9953-5ff30861f749',1,null,null,'spoken & written','makes nouns from adjectives ending in -able and -ible',null,null,'از صفت هایی که به -able و -ible ختم می شوند اسم می سازد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"manageability","translation":"مدیریت پذیری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000786579.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b9205e9b-43b2-51ef-b143-07f40aab226f','6a95a74b-9ddf-5267-8fcd-3e9d8b7c4ac0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when you are not in the place where people expect you to be, or the time that you are away','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'غیبت، عدم حضور؛ فقدان، کمبود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long absence She was apprehensive about studying again after such a long absence.','a prolonged absence (= continuing for a long time ) Requests for prolonged absence during term time are strongly discouraged.','a lengthy absence The injury may mean a lengthy absence from the team.','a brief absence Everything seemed to have changed during his brief absence.','frequent absences (= happening often ) She disliked Stephen''s frequent absences on business.','repeated absences (= happening again and again ) Repeated absences from school can lead to children falling behind.','a temporary absence No one noticed her temporary absence.','a sudden absence It wasn''t easy to deal with Hugh''s sudden absence.','an unexplained absence Did he give a reason for his unexplained absence?','unauthorized absence (= that you do not have permission for ) With the older pupils, unauthorized absence increased.','somebody''s absence from work/school You will be entitled to sick pay in respect of any absence from work through sickness.','a period of absence You must submit a doctor''s statement to cover the period of absence beyond the seventh day.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Ms Leighton will be in charge during my absence (= while I am away ) .","translation":"خانم لیتون در زمان غیبت من (= تا زمانی که من دور هستم) مسئول خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000787250.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her work involved repeated absences from home.","translation":"کار او شامل غیبت های مکرر از خانه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619157.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4c2ceb50-bded-5dbf-ba37-2004664ec744','6a95a74b-9ddf-5267-8fcd-3e9d8b7c4ac0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the lack of something or the fact that it does not exist','[ singular ]',null,'فقدان چیزی یا عدم وجود آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long absence She was apprehensive about studying again after such a long absence.','a prolonged absence (= continuing for a long time ) Requests for prolonged absence during term time are strongly discouraged.','a lengthy absence The injury may mean a lengthy absence from the team.','a brief absence Everything seemed to have changed during his brief absence.','frequent absences (= happening often ) She disliked Stephen''s frequent absences on business.','repeated absences (= happening again and again ) Repeated absences from school can lead to children falling behind.','a temporary absence No one noticed her temporary absence.','a sudden absence It wasn''t easy to deal with Hugh''s sudden absence.','an unexplained absence Did he give a reason for his unexplained absence?','unauthorized absence (= that you do not have permission for ) With the older pupils, unauthorized absence increased.','somebody''s absence from work/school You will be entitled to sick pay in respect of any absence from work through sickness.','a period of absence You must submit a doctor''s statement to cover the period of absence beyond the seventh day.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a complete absence of any kind of planning","translation":"فقدان کامل هر نوع برنامه ریزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000787257.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the absence of any evidence, the police had to let Myers go.","translation":"در غیاب هیچ مدرکی، پلیس مجبور شد مایرز را رها کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000787261.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6e163453-2665-51c6-8c83-792460b65a5b','6a95a74b-9ddf-5267-8fcd-3e9d8b7c4ac0',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'absence makes the heart grow fonder','غیبت، عدم حضور؛ فقدان، کمبود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long absence She was apprehensive about studying again after such a long absence.','a prolonged absence (= continuing for a long time ) Requests for prolonged absence during term time are strongly discouraged.','a lengthy absence The injury may mean a lengthy absence from the team.','a brief absence Everything seemed to have changed during his brief absence.','frequent absences (= happening often ) She disliked Stephen''s frequent absences on business.','repeated absences (= happening again and again ) Repeated absences from school can lead to children falling behind.','a temporary absence No one noticed her temporary absence.','a sudden absence It wasn''t easy to deal with Hugh''s sudden absence.','an unexplained absence Did he give a reason for his unexplained absence?','unauthorized absence (= that you do not have permission for ) With the older pupils, unauthorized absence increased.','somebody''s absence from work/school You will be entitled to sick pay in respect of any absence from work through sickness.','a period of absence You must submit a doctor''s statement to cover the period of absence beyond the seventh day.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8b924102-c815-5f7b-9c99-2ea6db70a818','7c3a74d2-f738-55ee-ad92-f926521da4ca',1,'description','توضیحات','spoken & written','a written or spoken description that says what happens in an event or process',null,null,'روایت، شرح؛ حساب (بانکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give an account Marshall gave the police his account of how the fight started.','provide an account Freud has provided an account of the human psyche’s stages of development.','write an account He later wrote an account of his experiences during the war.','read an account Have you read his account of the journey?','a detailed account She gave me a detailed account of what happened at the meeting.','a full account It is not possible to give a full account of what we discussed.','a short account What follows is a short account of the legal procedure.','a brief account The class were asked to write a brief account of their holidays.','a clear account I’ve tried to write a clear account of the incident.','an accurate account Both newspapers gave fairly accurate accounts of what had happened.','a true account The book is a true account of his life and death.','a blow-by-blow account (= very detailed ) Rosemary gave me a blow-by-blow account of their trip.','a graphic account (= very clear with a lot of details, especially unpleasant details ) He wrote a graphic account of his time in jail.','a vivid account (= so clear that it seems real or like real life ) I read a vivid account of his experiences in Egypt.','an eye-witness account (= an account of an event, given by the person who saw it happen ) an eye-witness account of the attack','a first-hand account (= an account of a situation, given by the person who experienced it ) a first-hand account of life in the refugee camps','conflicting accounts (= different accounts of the same event, that cannot both be true ) There were conflicting accounts of what actually happened.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was too shocked to give an account of what had happened.","translation":"او آنقدر شوکه شده بود که نمی‌توانست آنچه را که اتفاق افتاده بود ارائه دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654804.mp3"},{"sentence":"a blow-by-blow account of how England lost to Portugal","translation":"گزارش ضربه به ضربه از نحوه شکست انگلیس به پرتغال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654808.mp3"},{"sentence":"Chomsky’s account of how children learn their first language","translation":"گزارش چامسکی از چگونگی یادگیری زبان اول کودکان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000966675.mp3"},{"sentence":"Eye-witness accounts told of the unprovoked shooting of civilians.","translation":"گزارش های شاهدان عینی از تیراندازی بی دلیل به غیرنظامیان خبر می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654816.mp3"},{"sentence":"This gives a first-hand account of the war.","translation":"این یک گزارش دست اول از جنگ است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654817.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c1f747c9-c322-56d2-a15d-3223ce2c4c3a','7c3a74d2-f738-55ee-ad92-f926521da4ca',2,'at a bank','در یک بانک','spoken & written','an arrangement in which a bank keeps your money safe so that you can pay more in or take money out',null,'bank account , checking account , current account , deposit account , profit and loss account , savings account','ترتیبی که در آن یک بانک پول شما را ایمن نگه می دارد تا بتوانید پول بیشتری را وارد یا خارج کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give an account Marshall gave the police his account of how the fight started.','provide an account Freud has provided an account of the human psyche’s stages of development.','write an account He later wrote an account of his experiences during the war.','read an account Have you read his account of the journey?','a detailed account She gave me a detailed account of what happened at the meeting.','a full account It is not possible to give a full account of what we discussed.','a short account What follows is a short account of the legal procedure.','a brief account The class were asked to write a brief account of their holidays.','a clear account I’ve tried to write a clear account of the incident.','an accurate account Both newspapers gave fairly accurate accounts of what had happened.','a true account The book is a true account of his life and death.','a blow-by-blow account (= very detailed ) Rosemary gave me a blow-by-blow account of their trip.','a graphic account (= very clear with a lot of details, especially unpleasant details ) He wrote a graphic account of his time in jail.','a vivid account (= so clear that it seems real or like real life ) I read a vivid account of his experiences in Egypt.','an eye-witness account (= an account of an event, given by the person who saw it happen ) an eye-witness account of the attack','a first-hand account (= an account of a situation, given by the person who experienced it ) a first-hand account of life in the refugee camps','conflicting accounts (= different accounts of the same event, that cannot both be true ) There were conflicting accounts of what actually happened.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"My salary is paid into my bank account.","translation":"حقوق من به حساب بانکی من واریز می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000966685.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve opened an account with Barclay’s Bank.","translation":"من یک حساب در بانک بارکلی باز کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654825.mp3"},{"sentence":"My husband and I have a joint account (= one that is shared between two people ) .","translation":"من و شوهرم یک حساب مشترک داریم (= حسابی که بین دو نفر مشترک است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654829.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
