('569fe1ff-d2d8-51b2-bb7a-560731a73e11','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',1,'newspaper/magazine','روزنامه/مجله','spoken & written','a piece of writing about a particular subject in a newspaper or magazine',null,null,'مقاله؛ بند، ماده (قانونی)؛ حرف تعریف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an article on environmental issues","translation":"مقاله ای در مورد مسائل زیست محیطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664356.mp3"},{"sentence":"The paper’s leading article (= the main article ) described the government as weak.","translation":"مقاله اصلی روزنامه (= مقاله اصلی) دولت را ضعیف توصیف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664357.mp3"},{"sentence":"newspaper articles","translation":"مقالات روزنامه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664362.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('135f7f47-e912-5c9c-b73c-0db57049381b','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',2,'object','شی','formal','a thing, especially one of a group of things',null,null,'یک چیز، به ویژه یکی از گروهی از چیزها',array['item']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"household articles","translation":"اقلام خانگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991121.mp3"},{"sentence":"She only took a few articles of clothing with her.","translation":"او فقط چند لباس با خود برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001664366.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e4bb8128-a022-5466-bbdb-190288df66e5','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',3,'law','قانون','spoken & written','a part of a law or legal agreement that deals with a particular point',null,null,'بخشی از یک قانون یا قرارداد حقوقی که به یک نکته خاص می پردازد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Article 1 of the constitution guarantees freedom of religion.","translation":"اصل 1 قانون اساسی آزادی مذهب را تضمین می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000991132.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5c84a2e6-7fe5-5886-8773-3297cae9d318','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',4,'grammar','دستور زبان','technical','a word used before a noun to show whether the noun refers to a particular example of something or to a general example of something. In English, ‘the’ is called the definite article and ‘a’ and ‘an’ are called the indefinite article.',null,null,'کلمه ای که قبل از اسم استفاده می شود تا نشان دهد که آیا اسم به مثال خاصی از چیزی اشاره دارد یا به مثال کلی چیزی. در زبان انگلیسی به «the» حرف معین و «a» و «an» حرف نامعین گفته می‌شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ce331724-e415-5760-bdfd-b42caa29a7cb','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'articles','مقاله؛ بند، ماده (قانونی)؛ حرف تعریف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bff2fced-54f5-5571-a50a-d919f1e927ff','0d722826-3a16-5955-8003-d825537b659e',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'an article of faith','مقاله؛ بند، ماده (قانونی)؛ حرف تعریف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a newspaper article He writes newspaper articles in the Guardian.','a magazine article The couple talked frankly about their joy at having a new baby in a magazine article published yesterday.','a feature article (= one about a particular subject ) I wrote a few feature articles on sporting events.','a good/excellent/interesting article There was an interesting article on Russia in the paper today.','the leading/lead article (= the main article ) Look at this leading article from Newsweek’s business section.','a front-page article The protest followed a front-page article in the Herald three weeks ago.','an in-depth article (= one that is detailed ) Each issue contains in-depth articles and photographs.','write/do an article The Times have asked me if I will do an article on the election.','read/see an article It was good to see such an intelligent article on censorship.','publish/carry/run an article (= print it in a newspaper or magazine ) The magazine carried an article on the dangers of being overweight.','an article appears in a newspaper/magazine A couple of articles appeared in local papers, but nothing else.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ef1d0f95-1c6e-5d95-a96f-f302b0ca352e','aaced37a-01ea-5757-9c6a-db5e9d4b3bf3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','feeling very sorry and embarrassed because of something you have done',null,null,'شرمنده، خجل (از کاری)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I felt ashamed of the things I’d said to him.","translation":"از چیزهایی که به او گفته بودم احساس شرمندگی کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663969.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m ashamed to admit that I’ve never read any of his books.","translation":"من شرم دارم اعتراف کنم که هیچ یک از کتاب های او را نخوانده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663972.mp3"},{"sentence":"She felt ashamed that she had missed her sister’s wedding.","translation":"از اینکه عروسی خواهرش را از دست داده بود احساس شرم می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000107.mp3"},{"sentence":"Alan was deeply ashamed when he remembered what he’d said.","translation":"آلن وقتی به یاد حرف هایش افتاد عمیقا شرمنده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000108.mp3"},{"sentence":"Everyone cries sometimes – it’s nothing to be ashamed of .","translation":"همه گاهی اوقات گریه می کنند - این چیزی نیست که از آن خجالت بکشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663979.mp3"},{"sentence":"You should be ashamed of yourself.","translation":"باید از خودت خجالت بکشی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001663984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('e3ef9e64-7f8b-5985-a15e-798032baac6a','aaced37a-01ea-5757-9c6a-db5e9d4b3bf3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','feeling uncomfortable because someone does something that embarrasses you',null,null,'احساس ناراحتی می کنید زیرا کسی کاری انجام می دهد که شما را شرمنده می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many children feel ashamed of their parents.","translation":"بسیاری از کودکان از والدین خود احساس شرمندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000921538.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their behaviour makes me ashamed to be British.","translation":"رفتار آنها باعث می شود من از بریتانیایی بودن خجالت بکشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000921541.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('dba72acd-201b-551c-a591-968ecdea7788','74520e10-bcdc-533c-a295-ca105363dfda',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an act of trying to do something, especially something difficult',null,null,'تلاش، اقدام (به‌ویژه برای کار دشوار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make an attempt She made several attempts to escape.','abandon/give up an attempt They had to abandon their attempt to climb the mountain.','fail/succeed in your attempt He failed in his attempt to set a new Olympic record.','foil/thwart an attempt formal (= make it fail ) Troops loyal to the general foiled the assassination attempt.','an attempt fails/succeeds All attempts to find a cure have failed.','on the first/second etc attempt ( also at the first/second etc attempt British English ) The car started at the second attempt.','a vain attempt (= one that does not succeed ) They worked through the night in a vain attempt to finish on schedule.','a desperate attempt (= that involves a lot of effort ) Doctors made a desperate attempt to save his life.','a deliberate/conscious attempt His question was a deliberate attempt to humiliate her.','a serious/genuine attempt This is the first serious attempt to tackle the problem.','an unsuccessful/successful attempt an unsuccessful attempt to overthrow the government','an abortive attempt formal (= unsuccessful ) They made an abortive attempt to keep the company going.','a futile attempt (= certain to fail and not worth doing ) I jumped up and down in a futile attempt to keep warm.','a doomed attempt (= certain to fail, and causing something very bad to happen ) His attempt to reach the Pole was doomed from the beginning.','a brave/bold/gallant/valiant attempt approving (= one that you admire, but that is unsuccessful ) The previous government made a brave attempt to tackle the problem. She made a valiant attempt to continue playing, but the pain was too much.','a blatant attempt disapproving (= when someone openly tries to do something bad ) It was a blatant attempt to hide the truth.','a final/last attempt They made one final attempt to make their marriage work.','a last-ditch attempt (= a final attempt to achieve something before it is too late ) Negotiators are making a last-ditch attempt to save the agreement.','a rescue attempt Two firefighters were hurt in the rescue attempt.','an assassination attempt (= an attempt to kill a leader ) De Gaulle survived an assassination attempt in 1961.','a suicide attempt (= an attempt to kill yourself ) He was admitted to hospital after a suicide attempt.','a coup attempt (= an attempt to change the government, usually by force ) The US helped to crush the coup attempt.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"All attempts to control inflation have failed.","translation":"تمام تلاش ها برای کنترل تورم شکست خورده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000925821.mp3"},{"sentence":"her feeble attempts at humour","translation":"تلاش های ضعیف او برای شوخ طبعی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000120.mp3"},{"sentence":"She passed her driving test at the first attempt.","translation":"او در اولین تلاش امتحان رانندگی خود را قبول کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659617.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
