('712ad5a0-18f1-565e-84b3-7f45fdf7e27d','42a827b2-4d9d-597d-87c4-e61a63b6a8c3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a rule , problem etc that prevents people from doing something, or limits what they can do',null,null,'مانع، سد؛ حائل (فیزیکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['trade barriers (= things such as taxes that make trade between countries difficult ) The aim was to remove trade barriers and open up free markets.','the language barrier (= the problem of understanding people who do not speak the same language ) Living in China was hard for me at first because of the language barrier.','cultural/racial/class barriers Sport is a sure way to break down racial barriers.','social barriers The Internet allows people of all ages to interact without the usual social barriers.','technical/legal/political barriers Most of the technical barriers have been solved.','artificial barriers They were committed to breaking down the artificial barriers to women’s achievement.','regulatory barriers Regulatory barriers have been an obstacle to international co-operation between police forces.','bureaucratic barriers This is one of many bureaucratic barriers preventing the unemployed from claiming benefit.','institutional/organizational barriers Institutional barriers limit what can be achieved.','break/tear down barriers Most companies have broken down the old barriers of status among the workers.','cross/transcend barriers (= avoid barriers that usually exist ) Music has the great advantage of crossing cultural barriers.','remove/eliminate/lift barriers Will this remove the barriers to change?','overcome barriers There are still many more barriers that need to be overcome.','reduce/lower barriers We should be reducing barriers to imports from poor countries.','erect/build/put up barriers Some kids have erected emotional barriers that stop them from learning.','create barriers Uniforms are one of the things that create barriers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He advocated the removal of trade barriers.","translation":"او از رفع موانع تجاری حمایت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000148.mp3"},{"sentence":"Problems with childcare remain the biggest barrier to women succeeding at work.","translation":"مشکلات مربوط به مراقبت از کودکان همچنان بزرگترین مانع برای موفقیت زنان در کار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000934832.mp3"},{"sentence":"barriers between doctors and patients","translation":"موانع بین پزشکان و بیماران","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658515.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8de31de8-16fc-51ca-872a-27fdc935c8e7','42a827b2-4d9d-597d-87c4-e61a63b6a8c3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a type of fence or gate that prevents people from moving in a particular direction',null,null,'نوعی حصار یا دروازه که از حرکت افراد در جهت خاصی جلوگیری می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['trade barriers (= things such as taxes that make trade between countries difficult ) The aim was to remove trade barriers and open up free markets.','the language barrier (= the problem of understanding people who do not speak the same language ) Living in China was hard for me at first because of the language barrier.','cultural/racial/class barriers Sport is a sure way to break down racial barriers.','social barriers The Internet allows people of all ages to interact without the usual social barriers.','technical/legal/political barriers Most of the technical barriers have been solved.','artificial barriers They were committed to breaking down the artificial barriers to women’s achievement.','regulatory barriers Regulatory barriers have been an obstacle to international co-operation between police forces.','bureaucratic barriers This is one of many bureaucratic barriers preventing the unemployed from claiming benefit.','institutional/organizational barriers Institutional barriers limit what can be achieved.','break/tear down barriers Most companies have broken down the old barriers of status among the workers.','cross/transcend barriers (= avoid barriers that usually exist ) Music has the great advantage of crossing cultural barriers.','remove/eliminate/lift barriers Will this remove the barriers to change?','overcome barriers There are still many more barriers that need to be overcome.','reduce/lower barriers We should be reducing barriers to imports from poor countries.','erect/build/put up barriers Some kids have erected emotional barriers that stop them from learning.','create barriers Uniforms are one of the things that create barriers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Crowds burst through the barriers and ran onto the pitch.","translation":"جمعیت از موانع عبور کردند و به سمت زمین مسابقه دویدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000934825.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
