('8c36d577-d3c4-5178-b7f2-752482b0c618','fa56f392-0f16-5d0d-ab77-c1ab7215141c',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'recharge your batteries','باتری، باتری برقی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['flat British English , dead American English (= with no more electricity in it ) I''d left the headlights on and the battery was completely flat.','low (= with little electricity in it ) He could see the battery was low on his laptop.','a car/torch/phone etc battery Have you checked your mobile phone battery?','a rechargeable battery (= one that you can put more electricity in and use again ) The camera uses rechargeable batteries.','a spare battery (= an extra one, in case you need it ) Take a torch and spare batteries.','change/replace the battery (= put a new battery in something ) You may need to change the battery in the smoke alarm.','charge/recharge a battery (= put more electricity in it ) It takes eight hours to fully recharge the battery.','use batteries ( also run on batteries ) The clock runs on two 9-volt batteries.','put a battery in She had put new batteries in the radio.','take a battery out I''ll take the batteries out while I''m not using it.','a battery charger (= a piece of equipment for charging batteries ) Don''t forget to pack your battery charger.','battery power You can plug your laptop in or use it on battery power.','battery life (= how long a battery produces electricity ) My old phone had a longer battery life.','battery powered/operated A lot of children''s toys are battery operated.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('200cd3c1-db36-5d3e-bff9-734725f4c6d6','0dd7b865-86c7-5809-9fc6-bdc1630107a3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used when you are giving the reason for something',null,null,'زیرا، چون که','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We didn’t enjoy the day because the weather was so awful.","translation":"ما از آن روز لذت نبردیم زیرا هوا بسیار بد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677527.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Why can’t I go?’ ‘Because you’re not old enough.’","translation":"\"چرا نمی توانم بروم؟\" \"چون تو به اندازه کافی بزرگ نیستی.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001008103.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hubert never experienced any fear, and this was partly because he was not particularly intelligent.","translation":"هوبرت هرگز هیچ ترسی را تجربه نکرد، و این تا حدی به این دلیل بود که او از باهوشی خاصی برخوردار نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677529.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many exam candidates lose marks simply because they do not read the questions properly.","translation":"بسیاری از داوطلبان امتحان فقط به این دلیل که سوالات را به درستی نمی خوانند، نمره خود را از دست می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677533.mp3"},{"sentence":"I decided to go with them, mainly because I had nothing better to do.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتم با آنها بروم، عمدتاً به این دلیل که کار بهتری برای انجام دادن نداشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001677537.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('4e939017-3c58-57bc-9144-67d08fb5785c','0dd7b865-86c7-5809-9fc6-bdc1630107a3',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'just because ...','زیرا، چون که','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d6f62a85-3120-56d1-9fa1-bbac44013d73','d9d82a5f-d051-57f7-b7e2-8d10e8e1bba5',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'because of somebody/something','به دلیلِ، به‌خاطرِ (because of)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('17f2d96f-6289-5251-9dda-eb3a21020d83','079745aa-bb2f-52d5-9294-bc13d2d29c4a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a room for sleeping in',null,null,'اتاق خواب','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a single bedroom (= with a bed for one person ) We have one single bedroom and two doubles.','a double bedroom (= with a big bed for two people ) I''d like to book a double bedroom for two nights, please.','a twin bedroom (= with two single beds ) Do you prefer a double or a twin bedroom?','the main/master bedroom (= the biggest bedroom in a house ) The master bedroom has a view of the sea.','the spare bedroom (= for visitors ) She set up a home office in the spare bedroom.','a study bedroom (= for students, with a bed and a desk ) In my first year at university I had a really tiny study bedroom.','bedroom furniture All the bedroom furniture was old and falling apart.','the bedroom door/window etc Did you shut the bedroom window?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a hotel with 50 bedrooms","translation":"هتلی با 50 اتاق خواب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000911544.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’ve just bought a new four-bedroomed house in Edinburgh.","translation":"آنها به تازگی یک خانه چهار خوابه جدید در ادینبورگ خریداری کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001674706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7605c0d3-8da7-592d-b563-af71322e6c36','079745aa-bb2f-52d5-9294-bc13d2d29c4a',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'bedroom eyes','اتاق خواب','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a single bedroom (= with a bed for one person ) We have one single bedroom and two doubles.','a double bedroom (= with a big bed for two people ) I''d like to book a double bedroom for two nights, please.','a twin bedroom (= with two single beds ) Do you prefer a double or a twin bedroom?','the main/master bedroom (= the biggest bedroom in a house ) The master bedroom has a view of the sea.','the spare bedroom (= for visitors ) She set up a home office in the spare bedroom.','a study bedroom (= for students, with a bed and a desk ) In my first year at university I had a really tiny study bedroom.','bedroom furniture All the bedroom furniture was old and falling apart.','the bedroom door/window etc Did you shut the bedroom window?']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7fe763d7-ef52-56b2-b98a-34f83c8add72','2b06c5f9-5777-542d-ba39-7ff0bd73e335',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to be sure that something is true or that someone is telling the truth','[ transitive ]',null,'باور داشتن، اعتقاد داشتن؛ قبول کردن (حرف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You shouldn’t believe everything you read.","translation":"شما نباید هر چیزی را که می خوانید باور کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001013542.mp3"},{"sentence":"I believed him, even though his story sounded unlikely.","translation":"من او را باور کردم، اگرچه داستان او بعید به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671172.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t believe he’s only 25.","translation":"من باور نمی کنم که او فقط 25 سال دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671175.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t believe a word of it (= I think it is completely untrue ) .","translation":"من یک کلمه از آن را باور نمی کنم (= فکر می کنم کاملاً نادرست است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671176.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c6696826-bff6-5c15-970e-fe1fd02342d6','2b06c5f9-5777-542d-ba39-7ff0bd73e335',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something is true or possible , although you are not completely sure','[ transitive ]',null,'فکر کنید که چیزی درست یا ممکن است، اگرچه کاملا مطمئن نیستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Detectives believe that the victim knew his killer.","translation":"کارآگاهان معتقدند مقتول قاتل خود را می شناخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671183.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is believed that the house was built in 1735.","translation":"اعتقاد بر این است که این خانه در سال 1735 ساخته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671184.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Have they arrived yet?’ ‘Yes, I believe so.’","translation":"\"آیا آنها هنوز وارد شده اند؟\" \"بله، من اینطور معتقدم.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001013620.mp3"},{"sentence":"At 115, Mrs Jackson is believed to be the oldest person in the country.","translation":"گمان می رود خانم جکسون با ۱۱۵ سالگی مسن ترین فرد کشور باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671187.mp3"},{"sentence":"The four men are widely believed (= believed by a lot of people ) to have been killed by their captors.","translation":"این چهار مرد به طور گسترده بر این باورند (= بسیاری از مردم معتقدند) که توسط اسیرکنندگان خود کشته شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671191.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you honestly believe that I’d be stupid enough to do that?","translation":"آیا صادقانه باور کردید که من آنقدر احمق خواهم بود که این کار را انجام دهم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671196.mp3"},{"sentence":"I firmly believe that the business will be a success.","translation":"من کاملاً معتقدم که این تجارت موفقیت آمیز خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671200.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
