('1228137a-a239-59bd-b4ff-e2fbe568e70a','033c3047-7fd9-5220-99d8-7600ae388032',10,null,null,'spoken & written','used when it is difficult to give an exact description of something and you therefore have to compare it to two things that are similar to it',null,null,'زمانی استفاده می شود که توصیف دقیق چیزی دشوار است و بنابراین باید آن را با دو مورد مشابه آن مقایسه کنید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He uttered a sound that was something between a sigh and a groan.","translation":"او صدایی را بیان کرد که چیزی بین آه و ناله بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001016813.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('847a0c92-e31b-56b9-96ee-1e83e5fcbfb3','ee432d68-4dea-55b6-8747-dc561cf5432f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a vehicle with two wheels that you ride by pushing its pedal s with your feet',null,'exercise bike','دوچرخه',array['bike']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['ride a bicycle Riding a bicycle is very good exercise.','get on/off a bicycle I got on my bicycle and cycled over to Rob’s house.','push/wheel a bicycle (= walk beside it pushing it ) She was wheeling her bicycle and talking to some friends.','a bicycle shop ( also bicycle store American English ) His dream was to own a bicycle shop.','a bicycle ride They went for a 50 km bicycle ride.','a bicycle wheel/tyre My front bicycle tyre is flat.','a bicycle pump (= for putting more air in a tyre ) Where’s the bicycle pump?','a bicycle helmet It’s safer to wear a bicycle helmet.','a bicycle shed (= place for keeping bicycles in ) He built a bicycle shed in the back yard.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can James ride a bicycle yet?","translation":"آیا جیمز هنوز می تواند دوچرخه سواری کند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000916418.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
