('42d293f6-ecf6-583a-a47b-ea8bda0ba7dd','be17a0fa-440d-51c0-b6cb-fe7a4ba6cb39',1,'middle','وسط','spoken & written','in the middle of an area or an object','[ only before noun, no comparative ]',null,'مرکزی، وسطی؛ اساسی، محوری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He lives in central London.","translation":"او در مرکز لندن زندگی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659078.mp3"},{"sentence":"The roof is supported by a central column.","translation":"سقف توسط یک ستون مرکزی پشتیبانی می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878408.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5d311eab-0191-5288-833b-d5ae703e5d0c','be17a0fa-440d-51c0-b6cb-fe7a4ba6cb39',2,'from one place','از یک مکان','spoken & written','used about the part of an organization , system etc which controls the rest of it, or its work','[ only before noun, no comparative ]',null,'در مورد بخشی از یک سازمان، سیستم و غیره استفاده می شود که بقیه آن یا کار آن را کنترل می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the party’s central office","translation":"دفتر مرکزی حزب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659083.mp3"},{"sentence":"the system’s central control unit","translation":"واحد کنترل مرکزی سیستم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878402.mp3"},{"sentence":"central planning","translation":"برنامه ریزی مرکزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878399.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b65b9bad-31e9-5443-b070-ee85d4299089','be17a0fa-440d-51c0-b6cb-fe7a4ba6cb39',3,'important','مهم است','spoken & written','more important and having more influence than anything else',null,null,'مهم تر و تاثیرگذارتر از هر چیز دیگری است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a central role/part The report emphasizes the central role of science in society.','a central issue Education is a central issue for the government.','a central theme What would you say is the central theme of the book?','a central figure (= an important person with a lot of influence ) During this time he was a central figure in American politics.','a central feature Cultural diversity is a central feature of modern British society.','be of central importance Loving care is of central importance to a child’s development.','a central concern Environmental problems are now a central concern.','a central idea This was a central idea in Marxist theory.','a central argument (= the main set of reasons for or against something ) Let’s consider the central argument for reducing the voting age.','a central aspect The spread of ideas is a central aspect of globalization.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"values which are central to our society","translation":"ارزش هایی که در جامعه ما نقش اساسی دارند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878415.mp3"},{"sentence":"Owen played a central role in the negotiations.","translation":"اوون نقش محوری در مذاکرات داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878412.mp3"},{"sentence":"His ideas were of central importance in the development of the theory.","translation":"ایده‌های او در بسط نظریه اهمیت اساسی داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878418.mp3"},{"sentence":"Education has become a central issue in public debate.","translation":"آموزش به یک موضوع اصلی در بحث عمومی تبدیل شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878421.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('73540451-6f6d-5a13-b047-e8a047c9b6f4','be17a0fa-440d-51c0-b6cb-fe7a4ba6cb39',4,'easy access','دسترسی آسان','spoken & written','a place that is central is easy to reach because it is near the middle of a town or area',null,null,'دسترسی به مکانی که مرکزی است آسان است زیرا نزدیک وسط یک شهر یا منطقه است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s very central, just five minutes’ walk from the main square.","translation":"بسیار مرکزی است، فقط پنج دقیقه پیاده تا میدان اصلی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878425.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('018fde48-32f3-534e-aba1-d15c038701c9','2faba643-11d5-58ad-a403-81d22c6260f4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','full of a particular type of thing or person',null,null,'پر از نوع خاصی از چیز یا شخص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was mosquito-central down by the river.","translation":"در مرکز پشه در کنار رودخانه قرار داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002095714.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the 1990s, London’s docklands became yuppie-central (= full of rich young people ) .","translation":"در دهه 1990، اسکله های لندن به مرکزیت یوپی (= پر از جوانان ثروتمند) تبدیل شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020030.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('30a60210-dbde-5637-84e3-ec574004d66b','f138318c-7ea8-5472-bb5d-94aafeb75466',1,null,null,'spoken & written','one of the 100-year periods measured from before or after the year of Christ’s birth',null,null,'قرن، سده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the 18th/19th/20th/21st etc century The movie is set in the 18th century.','the early/mid/late 18th etc century the industrial towns of the early 19th century','the last/next century The boats were built in the last century.','the present century The present century has seen the start of international terrorism.','the beginning of the century Coco Chanel was born in France at the beginning of the century.','the turn of the century (= the time when one century ends and another begins ) The town was expanding at the turn of the century.','the end/close of the century He was writing his books towards the end of the 19th century.','the first/second half of the century In the second half of the century, people''s wages began to rise.','18th-/19th- etc century art/music/literature Nothing compares with Florence''s beautiful 15th-century architecture.','a16th-/19th- etc century house/church etc They live in a 17th-century farmhouse.','date from the 18th etc century (= it was started, built etc in the 18th etc century ) The present church dates from the 13th century.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The church was built in the 13th century.","translation":"این کلیسا در قرن سیزدهم ساخته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659118.mp3"},{"sentence":"by the beginning of the next century","translation":"تا آغاز قرن آینده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659121.mp3"},{"sentence":"the story of life on a small farm at the turn of the century (= the beginning of the century )","translation":"داستان زندگی در یک مزرعه کوچک در آغاز قرن (= آغاز قرن)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659122.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('14ce18e3-133d-58b3-a5c2-c40daa7c0fff','f138318c-7ea8-5472-bb5d-94aafeb75466',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a period of 100 years',null,null,'یک دوره 100 ساله','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"many centuries ago","translation":"چندین قرن پیش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659125.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('36476569-93f4-5aef-bef4-71957f194dd4','f138318c-7ea8-5472-bb5d-94aafeb75466',3,null,null,'spoken & written','100 run s scored by one cricket player in an innings',null,null,'100 ران که توسط یک بازیکن کریکت در یک اینینگ به ثمر رسید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3da2553e-6465-560f-8718-ad53a698e708','f98d7c12-883a-5a48-913d-95f301e49073',1,null,null,'spoken & written','confident and sure , without any doubts','[ not before noun ]',null,'مطمئن، یقین‌دار؛ معین و مشخص',array['sure']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m absolutely certain that I left the keys in the kitchen.","translation":"من کاملاً مطمئن هستم که کلیدها را در آشپزخانه جا گذاشته ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878939.mp3"},{"sentence":"I felt certain that I’d passed the test.","translation":"من مطمئن بودم که امتحان را پس داده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659154.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not certain when it will be ready.","translation":"مطمئن نیستم کی آماده میشه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878942.mp3"},{"sentence":"Now, are you certain about that?","translation":"حالا، آیا در مورد آن مطمئن هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878945.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were watching him. He was certain of it.","translation":"آنها او را تماشا می کردند. او از آن مطمئن بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000878946.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m sure I gave him the money.","translation":"مطمئنم پول را به او دادم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,6),
('b14e9775-283d-5ce2-829d-005d45148b73','f98d7c12-883a-5a48-913d-95f301e49073',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if something is certain, it will definitely happen or is definitely true',null,null,'اگر چیزی قطعی باشد، قطعا اتفاق می افتد یا قطعا درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['it seems certain that … It seemed certain that the other team would win.','somebody seems/looks/appears certain to do something For a while the whole project looked certain to fail.','something is by no means certain (= not definite ) Victory was by no means certain for Smith.','something is far from certain (= not definite ) Success is far from certain.','fairly certain Opposition to the changes is fairly certain.','almost/virtually certain It is almost certain that she will be given a prison sentence. Prices are virtually certain to increase.','certain death If they stayed in the war zone, they faced almost certain death.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It now seems certain that there will be an election in May.","translation":"اکنون به نظر می رسد که انتخابات در ماه مه قطعی باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007455.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many people look certain to lose their jobs.","translation":"به نظر می رسد بسیاری از افراد شغل خود را از دست بدهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007460.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is wise to apply early to be certain of obtaining a place.","translation":"عاقلانه است که زودتر اقدام کنید تا از به دست آوردن مکان مطمئن شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007464.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not certain where he lived.","translation":"معلوم نیست کجا زندگی می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007468.mp3"},{"sentence":"His re-election was considered virtually certain .","translation":"انتخاب مجدد او تقریباً قطعی تلقی می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007471.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is by no means certain that the deal will be accepted.","translation":"پذیرفته شدن این معامله به هیچ وجه قطعی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007475.mp3"},{"sentence":"If they stayed in the war zone they would face certain death .","translation":"اگر در منطقه جنگی می ماندند با مرگ حتمی مواجه می شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007479.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
