('0dc2183f-349c-52b8-85b1-6410b95c233e','731984db-9f29-5c13-8a2c-0d049cd78f6f',1,'specialized education','آموزش تخصصی','spoken & written','a school for advanced education , especially in a particular profession or skill','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'کالج، آموزشگاه عالی؛ دانشکده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go to (a) college After university I went to drama college for a year.','attend (a) college formal: He was the first person in his family to attend college.','finish (at) college What are you going to do when you finish art college?','an art/music/drama college The Music College was founded in 1869.','an agricultural/secretarial/technical etc college I wanted a job in farm management so I went to agricultural college.','a teacher training college (= where you learn to be a teacher )','a military college (= where you learn to be an officer in the army )','a Further Education/FE college British English (= where adults can go to study, especially part-time )','a tutorial college British English (= where you can have private or small group lessons )','a sixth form college British English (= where students in Britain can go at 16, instead of a school )','a college student/teacher/lecturer a sixth-form college student']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a teacher training college","translation":"یک دانشکده تربیت معلم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000553324.mp3"},{"sentence":"Donna left school and went to art college.","translation":"دونا مدرسه را ترک کرد و به کالج هنر رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680477.mp3"},{"sentence":"the London College of Fashion","translation":"کالج مد لندن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001985970.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were great friends when we were at college.","translation":"زمانی که در دانشگاه بودیم، ما دوستان خوبی بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680483.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
