('f3099af6-134f-5830-b1e9-682eca71df3d','8dd0cdfb-9f24-59a2-b6f7-cf7909f1ad32',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'to whom it may concern','مربوط بودن، درباره بودن؛ نگران بودن؛ دل‌مشغولی داشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('78032ccb-2347-5d52-9ba3-c56ce25a9b48','6792da1c-12cc-5b43-aaa4-f1a78b9c6c0f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a performance given by musicians or singers',null,null,'کنسرت، برنامه موسیقی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go to a concert ( also attend a concert formal ) Do you want to go to the concert in the park this weekend?','give/do a concert The group gave concerts for charity throughout Europe.','play in/perform in a concert I''m playing in a jazz concert on Saturday night.','put on a concert ( also stage a concert formal ) (= arrange one ) The music club puts on regular concerts throughout the year.','a pop/rock/jazz/classical concert There were 150,000 people at the rock concert in Frankfurt.','an orchestral concert/a symphony concert (= one in which an orchestra plays ) Tickets for orchestral concerts range from $15 to $35.','a live concert (= that you watch as the performers play, rather than as a recording ) a live concert in front of 500 fans','an open-air/outdoor concert Clapton thrilled fans at a huge outdoor concert in New York.','a charity concert (= performed to raise money for charity ) 600 tickets have already been sold for the charity concert in June.','a gala concert (= performed to celebrate a special occasion ) a 75th anniversary gala concert','a brass-band concert (= performed by a brass band )','a concert performance She gave a number of concert performances in Berlin.','a concert tour (= a journey made by musicians to perform in different places ) This year we did a concert tour of the United States.','a concert hall On the last night, the concert hall was packed.','a concert ticket Concert tickets are available from $17.50.','a concert pianist (= who performs in concerts ) Her ambition was to become a concert pianist.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a rock concert","translation":"یک کنسرت راک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100400.mp3"},{"sentence":"a concert of French choral music","translation":"کنسرت موسیقی کرال فرانسه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688005.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were going to a concert in Bath Abbey.","translation":"قرار بود به کنسرتی در بت ابی برویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688006.mp3"},{"sentence":"She still does about 100 concerts every year.","translation":"او هنوز هم هر سال حدود 100 کنسرت برگزار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000354.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('7ddc595b-73c6-5f87-a2fd-a49d66479e5a','6792da1c-12cc-5b43-aaa4-f1a78b9c6c0f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in concert (with somebody)','کنسرت، برنامه موسیقی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go to a concert ( also attend a concert formal ) Do you want to go to the concert in the park this weekend?','give/do a concert The group gave concerts for charity throughout Europe.','play in/perform in a concert I''m playing in a jazz concert on Saturday night.','put on a concert ( also stage a concert formal ) (= arrange one ) The music club puts on regular concerts throughout the year.','a pop/rock/jazz/classical concert There were 150,000 people at the rock concert in Frankfurt.','an orchestral concert/a symphony concert (= one in which an orchestra plays ) Tickets for orchestral concerts range from $15 to $35.','a live concert (= that you watch as the performers play, rather than as a recording ) a live concert in front of 500 fans','an open-air/outdoor concert Clapton thrilled fans at a huge outdoor concert in New York.','a charity concert (= performed to raise money for charity ) 600 tickets have already been sold for the charity concert in June.','a gala concert (= performed to celebrate a special occasion ) a 75th anniversary gala concert','a brass-band concert (= performed by a brass band )','a concert performance She gave a number of concert performances in Berlin.','a concert tour (= a journey made by musicians to perform in different places ) This year we did a concert tour of the United States.','a concert hall On the last night, the concert hall was packed.','a concert ticket Concert tickets are available from $17.50.','a concert pianist (= who performs in concerts ) Her ambition was to become a concert pianist.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('95dc363f-664d-5470-86cf-baf2f8707031','4da0d97a-c729-57f2-bbe3-58c9bd79edab',1,'carry out','انجام دهد','spoken & written','to carry out a particular activity or process, especially in order to get information or prove facts','[ transitive ]',null,'انجام دادن، اجرا کردن؛ هدایت کردن (ارکستر)؛ رسانیدن (برق)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conduct research He’s conducting educational research at the University of Washington.','conduct a survey They conducted a survey of students’ careers one year after graduation.','conduct a study/review Scientists conducted a study of the area affected by the nuclear disaster.','conduct an investigation/inquiry Experts conducted an investigation into the causes of the crash.','conduct an interview Here are a few guidelines on how to conduct an interview.','conduct a campaign The party was criticized for the way it had conducted its election campaign.','conduct a test/experiment Investigators will be conducting tests to determine how the man died.','conduct a search The Spanish authorities conducted a nationwide search for the girl.','conduct (a) business The company had been conducting a lot of business in Latin America.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We are conducting a survey of consumer attitudes towards organic food.","translation":"ما در حال انجام یک نظرسنجی از نگرش مصرف کنندگان نسبت به مواد غذایی ارگانیک هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717190.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is it really necessary to conduct experiments on animals?","translation":"آیا واقعاً انجام آزمایش روی حیوانات ضروری است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845243.mp3"},{"sentence":"They conducted a campaign of bombings and assassinations.","translation":"آنها کارزار بمب گذاری و ترور را انجام دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845246.mp3"},{"sentence":"The interview was conducted in English.","translation":"مصاحبه به زبان انگلیسی انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845249.mp3"},{"sentence":"The memorial service was conducted by the Rev. David Prior.","translation":"مراسم یادبود توسط کشیش دیوید پریور انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717191.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was the first time that I had conducted business in Brazil.","translation":"این اولین باری بود که در برزیل تجارت می کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717193.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’re doing a survey of opinions about organic food.","translation":"آنها در حال بررسی نظرات در مورد غذاهای ارگانیک هستند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('fec120ec-b3dc-5107-9778-d227a03961ae','4da0d97a-c729-57f2-bbe3-58c9bd79edab',2,'music','موسیقی','spoken & written','to stand in front of a group of musicians or singers and direct their playing or singing','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'در مقابل گروهی از نوازندگان یا خواننده ها بایستند و نوازندگی یا آواز آنها را هدایت کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conduct research He’s conducting educational research at the University of Washington.','conduct a survey They conducted a survey of students’ careers one year after graduation.','conduct a study/review Scientists conducted a study of the area affected by the nuclear disaster.','conduct an investigation/inquiry Experts conducted an investigation into the causes of the crash.','conduct an interview Here are a few guidelines on how to conduct an interview.','conduct a campaign The party was criticized for the way it had conducted its election campaign.','conduct a test/experiment Investigators will be conducting tests to determine how the man died.','conduct a search The Spanish authorities conducted a nationwide search for the girl.','conduct (a) business The company had been conducting a lot of business in Latin America.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The orchestra is conducted by John Williams.","translation":"رهبری ارکستر را جان ویلیامز بر عهده دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717197.mp3"},{"sentence":"Who will be conducting?","translation":"چه کسی رهبری خواهد کرد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717198.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4545e238-3ba2-5717-8457-20f7a65ed2af','4da0d97a-c729-57f2-bbe3-58c9bd79edab',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'conduct yourself','انجام دادن، اجرا کردن؛ هدایت کردن (ارکستر)؛ رسانیدن (برق)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conduct research He’s conducting educational research at the University of Washington.','conduct a survey They conducted a survey of students’ careers one year after graduation.','conduct a study/review Scientists conducted a study of the area affected by the nuclear disaster.','conduct an investigation/inquiry Experts conducted an investigation into the causes of the crash.','conduct an interview Here are a few guidelines on how to conduct an interview.','conduct a campaign The party was criticized for the way it had conducted its election campaign.','conduct a test/experiment Investigators will be conducting tests to determine how the man died.','conduct a search The Spanish authorities conducted a nationwide search for the girl.','conduct (a) business The company had been conducting a lot of business in Latin America.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('176016e3-4ca4-56e0-9452-5c74a0188a2b','4da0d97a-c729-57f2-bbe3-58c9bd79edab',4,'electricity/heat','برق/گرما','spoken & written','if something conducts electricity or heat, it allows electricity or heat to travel along or through it','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر چیزی جریان الکتریسیته یا گرما را هدایت کند، به الکتریسیته یا گرما اجازه می دهد که در طول یا از طریق آن حرکت کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conduct research He’s conducting educational research at the University of Washington.','conduct a survey They conducted a survey of students’ careers one year after graduation.','conduct a study/review Scientists conducted a study of the area affected by the nuclear disaster.','conduct an investigation/inquiry Experts conducted an investigation into the causes of the crash.','conduct an interview Here are a few guidelines on how to conduct an interview.','conduct a campaign The party was criticized for the way it had conducted its election campaign.','conduct a test/experiment Investigators will be conducting tests to determine how the man died.','conduct a search The Spanish authorities conducted a nationwide search for the girl.','conduct (a) business The company had been conducting a lot of business in Latin America.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Aluminium, being a metal, readily conducts heat .","translation":"آلومینیوم که یک فلز است به راحتی گرما را هدایت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717201.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4c964233-b236-5009-84a5-80383029d5d7','4da0d97a-c729-57f2-bbe3-58c9bd79edab',5,'show somebody something','چیزی را به کسی نشان بده','formal','to take or lead someone somewhere','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'بردن یا هدایت کسی به جایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['conduct research He’s conducting educational research at the University of Washington.','conduct a survey They conducted a survey of students’ careers one year after graduation.','conduct a study/review Scientists conducted a study of the area affected by the nuclear disaster.','conduct an investigation/inquiry Experts conducted an investigation into the causes of the crash.','conduct an interview Here are a few guidelines on how to conduct an interview.','conduct a campaign The party was criticized for the way it had conducted its election campaign.','conduct a test/experiment Investigators will be conducting tests to determine how the man died.','conduct a search The Spanish authorities conducted a nationwide search for the girl.','conduct (a) business The company had been conducting a lot of business in Latin America.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"On arrival, I was conducted to the commandant’s office.","translation":"به محض ورود، مرا به دفتر فرماندهی بردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717209.mp3"},{"sentence":"a conducted tour of Berlin","translation":"یک تور انجام شده در برلین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001717213.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b09382fa-b628-5739-9689-757306b750b0','58a1fc4c-7525-5df9-ad36-16c4fecab630',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the way someone behaves , especially in public, in their job etc',null,null,'رفتار، کردار؛ اداره، هدایت (ارکستر)',array['behaviour']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['professional conduct There are strict rules that regulate lawyers’ professional conduct.','sexual conduct The politician’s sexual conduct had caused scandal.','violent conduct Their goalkeeper was sent off the field for violent conduct.','disorderly conduct (= behaving in a noisy or violent way in public ) Her husband was arrested for drunkenness and disorderly conduct.','criminal conduct In some cases of bullying, pupils may be guilty of criminal conduct.','proper/improper conduct (= correct/incorrect behaviour according to the normal rules or standards ) There was no evidence of improper conduct on the part of the police.','personal conduct You are expected to maintain a high standard of personal conduct at work.','unsportsmanlike conduct (= behaviour that is not acceptable in a fair competition ) He swore at the referee, and was penalized for unsportsmanlike conduct.','human conduct Societies have certain rules for normal human conduct.','a code of conduct (= a set of rules stating how you must behave ) All professions have a code of conduct.','rules/standards of conduct In war, there are established rules of conduct.','a course of conduct (= a set of actions ) The court said that when Harris had embarked on this course of conduct, he knew that it would put lives at risk.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Senator’s conduct is being investigated by the Ethics Committee.","translation":"رفتار سناتور توسط کمیته اخلاق در حال بررسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716829.mp3"},{"sentence":"an inquiry into the conduct of the police","translation":"تحقیق در مورد عملکرد پلیس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716830.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Law Society’s Code of Professional Conduct","translation":"آیین نامه رفتار حرفه ای جامعه حقوقی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716833.mp3"},{"sentence":"his arrest for disorderly conduct (= noisy violent behaviour )","translation":"دستگیری او به دلیل رفتار بی نظم (= رفتار خشونت آمیز پر سر و صدا)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716834.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('ab491a5b-ef4a-5e7d-a1f8-1a0f112634c7','58a1fc4c-7525-5df9-ad36-16c4fecab630',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'conduct of something','رفتار، کردار؛ اداره، هدایت (ارکستر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['professional conduct There are strict rules that regulate lawyers’ professional conduct.','sexual conduct The politician’s sexual conduct had caused scandal.','violent conduct Their goalkeeper was sent off the field for violent conduct.','disorderly conduct (= behaving in a noisy or violent way in public ) Her husband was arrested for drunkenness and disorderly conduct.','criminal conduct In some cases of bullying, pupils may be guilty of criminal conduct.','proper/improper conduct (= correct/incorrect behaviour according to the normal rules or standards ) There was no evidence of improper conduct on the part of the police.','personal conduct You are expected to maintain a high standard of personal conduct at work.','unsportsmanlike conduct (= behaviour that is not acceptable in a fair competition ) He swore at the referee, and was penalized for unsportsmanlike conduct.','human conduct Societies have certain rules for normal human conduct.','a code of conduct (= a set of rules stating how you must behave ) All professions have a code of conduct.','rules/standards of conduct In war, there are established rules of conduct.','a course of conduct (= a set of actions ) The court said that when Harris had embarked on this course of conduct, he knew that it would put lives at risk.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e50f7e6e-eb40-5bfb-8e11-f937bd15ec99','2e756151-5aab-50f8-91bd-22f355930589',1,'limit','محدود کردن','spoken & written','to keep someone or something within the limits of a particular activity or subject',null,null,'محدود کردن، محبوس کردن (در مکان یا قلمرو)',array['restrict']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police cadet’s duties were confined to taking statements from the crowd.","translation":"وظایف کادت پلیس به گرفتن اظهارات از جمعیت محدود می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102060.mp3"},{"sentence":"We confined our study to ten cases.","translation":"ما مطالعه خود را به ده مورد محدود کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000356.mp3"},{"sentence":"Owen did not confine himself to writing only one type of poem.","translation":"اوون تنها به نوشتن یک نوع شعر اکتفا نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102064.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0fcec147-6de9-5978-a5c3-983ec35252de','2e756151-5aab-50f8-91bd-22f355930589',2,'keep somebody in a place','نگه داشتن کسی در یک مکان','spoken & written','to keep someone in a place that they cannot leave, such as a prison',null,null,'نگه داشتن کسی در جایی که نمی تواند ترک کند، مانند زندان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Any soldier who leaves his post will be confined to barracks (= made to stay in the barracks ) .","translation":"هر سربازی که پست خود را ترک کند در پادگان (= مجبور به ماندن در پادگان) می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102090.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was allegedly confined in a narrow dark room for two months.","translation":"گفته می شود که او به مدت دو ماه در یک اتاق تاریک باریک محبوس بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102093.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('534cf9c8-5061-5886-9d11-0de7cae2c2a4','2e756151-5aab-50f8-91bd-22f355930589',3,'stop something spreading','جلوی انتشار چیزی را بگیرید','spoken & written','to stop something bad from spreading to another place',null,null,'برای جلوگیری از انتشار چیزی بد به جای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Firefighters managed to confine the fire to the living room.","translation":"آتش نشانان موفق به مهار آتش در اتاق نشیمن شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102101.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7f7f64b3-c5ea-50b5-8301-6d6678e87f02','2e756151-5aab-50f8-91bd-22f355930589',4,'stay in one place','در یک مکان بماند','spoken & written','if you are confined to a place, you have to stay in that place, especially because you are ill',null,null,'اگر در مکانی محبوس هستید، باید در آن مکان بمانید، به خصوص به دلیل اینکه بیمار هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Vaughan is confined to a wheelchair .","translation":"وان روی ویلچر بسته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703478.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s confined to bed with flu.","translation":"او به دلیل آنفولانزا در رختخواب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703482.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('93541d6e-8e24-5cca-b158-151444140ac8','911a3166-e7d8-521d-ba14-e296e4bd3ac6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to show that something is definitely true , especially by providing more proof',null,null,'تأیید کردن، تصدیق کردن؛ محکم کردن (بلیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"New evidence has confirmed the first witness’s story.","translation":"شواهد جدید داستان شاهد اول را تایید کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853506.mp3"},{"sentence":"To confirm my diagnosis I need to do some tests.","translation":"برای تایید تشخیص من باید چند آزمایش انجام دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703304.mp3"},{"sentence":"Research has confirmed that the risk is higher for women.","translation":"تحقیقات تایید کرده است که این خطر برای زنان بیشتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703307.mp3"},{"sentence":"The new results confirm what most of us knew already.","translation":"نتایج جدید آنچه را که بیشتر ما قبلاً می دانستیم تأیید می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853512.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was confirmed that the bone was broken.","translation":"تایید شد که استخوان شکسته است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('dad749c6-dcee-5728-a495-4203d42d0d71','911a3166-e7d8-521d-ba14-e296e4bd3ac6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to say that something is definitely true',null,null,'گفتن اینکه چیزی قطعا درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The president refused to confirm the rumor.","translation":"رئیس جمهور از تایید این شایعه خودداری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853524.mp3"},{"sentence":"Managers have so far refused to confirm or deny reports that up to 200 jobs are to go.","translation":"مدیران تاکنون از تایید یا تکذیب گزارش ها مبنی بر اینکه تا 200 شغل باقی مانده است، خودداری کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703310.mp3"},{"sentence":"Walsh confirmed that the money had been paid.","translation":"والش تایید کرد که پول پرداخت شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853527.mp3"},{"sentence":"My brother will confirm what I have told you.","translation":"برادرم آنچه را که به شما گفتم تایید خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853530.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4b2c5450-f8af-520c-84c8-5bbe511a5d4d','911a3166-e7d8-521d-ba14-e296e4bd3ac6',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to tell someone that a possible arrangement , date , or situation is now definite or official',null,null,'گفتن به کسی که ترتیب، تاریخ یا موقعیت احتمالی اکنون قطعی یا رسمی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Could you confirm the dates we discussed?","translation":"آیا می توانید تاریخ هایی را که در مورد آن صحبت کردیم را تأیید کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853534.mp3"},{"sentence":"Smith was confirmed as the club’s new manager yesterday.","translation":"اسمیت دیروز به عنوان سرمربی جدید باشگاه تایید شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703318.mp3"},{"sentence":"I am writing to confirm a booking for a single room for the night of 6 June.","translation":"من برای تأیید رزرو یک اتاق یک نفره برای شب 6 ژوئن می نویسم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703321.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5e1cdbd5-993e-57f3-849f-20963c749489','911a3166-e7d8-521d-ba14-e296e4bd3ac6',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to make you believe that your idea or feeling is right',null,null,'تا شما را باور کنید که ایده یا احساس شما درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This just confirms my worst fears.","translation":"این فقط بدترین ترس های من را تایید می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853516.mp3"},{"sentence":"The expression on his face confirmed me in my suspicions.","translation":"حالت صورتش من را در شکم تایید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000853520.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5a78c7ba-12f1-5e20-a258-cf5028569fa1','911a3166-e7d8-521d-ba14-e296e4bd3ac6',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be confirmed','تأیید کردن، تصدیق کردن؛ محکم کردن (بلیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('792efa9d-7488-5952-bd83-b1a1f7cc4e2b','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',1,'join things','به چیزها بپیوندید','spoken & written','to join two or more things together','[ transitive ]',null,'متصل کردن، وصل کردن؛ برقرار کردن (ارتباط)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The railway link would connect Felixstowe with Fishguard.","translation":"اتصال راه آهن Felixstowe را به Fishguard متصل می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675313.mp3"},{"sentence":"Connect the speakers to the CD player.","translation":"بلندگوها را به دستگاه پخش سی دی وصل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102908.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’d like two rooms with connecting doors (= doors that join the rooms ) .","translation":"ما دو اتاق با درهای متصل (= درهایی که به اتاق ها می پیوندند) می خواهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102912.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('3c43efbe-5f22-5b8a-8590-5c92488a46be','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',2,'relationship','رابطه','spoken & written','to realize or show that a fact, event, or person is related to something','[ transitive ]',null,'برای درک یا نشان دادن اینکه یک واقعیت، رویداد یا شخص به چیزی مرتبط است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I didn’t connect the two events in my mind.","translation":"من این دو رویداد را در ذهنم به هم مرتبط نکردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102919.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is no evidence to connect them with the attack.","translation":"هیچ مدرکی برای ارتباط آنها با حمله وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102922.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('24aa1fc2-b0e1-5516-aaf8-7d3f7ce38d12','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',3,'electricity/telephone etc','برق/تلفن و غیره','spoken & written','to join something to the main supply of electricity , gas , or water, or to a telephone or computer network','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'پیوستن چیزی به منبع اصلی برق، گاز یا آب، یا به یک شبکه تلفن یا کامپیوتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Click here to connect to the Internet.","translation":"برای اتصال به اینترنت اینجا را کلیک کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675324.mp3"},{"sentence":"Has the phone been connected yet?","translation":"آیا گوشی هنوز وصل شده است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102929.mp3"},{"sentence":"The power supply should be connected by a qualified electrician.","translation":"منبع تغذیه باید توسط یک برقکار ماهر وصل شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675325.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b2597ded-5c1a-5179-979b-e8a85fe02e14','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',4,'transport','حمل و نقل','spoken & written','if one train, flight etc connects with another, it arrives just before the other one leaves so that you can continue your journey','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر یک قطار، پرواز و غیره به قطار دیگری متصل شود، درست قبل از حرکت قطار دیگر می رسد تا بتوانید به سفر خود ادامه دهید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I missed the connecting flight .","translation":"من پرواز اتصال را از دست دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102947.mp3"},{"sentence":"This train connects with the one to Glasgow.","translation":"این قطار با قطار به گلاسکو متصل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102950.mp3"},{"sentence":"From Toronto you can connect to all other Air Canada destinations.","translation":"از تورنتو می توانید به سایر مقاصد ایر کانادا متصل شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675329.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('563508fc-44ed-533e-8429-cb4013cadb9d','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',5,'telephones','تلفن ها','spoken & written','to join two telephone lines so that two people can speak','[ transitive ]',null,'برای پیوستن به دو خط تلفن تا دو نفر بتوانند صحبت کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Please hold the line. I’m trying to connect you.","translation":"لطفا خط را نگه دارید. من سعی می کنم شما را وصل کنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102940.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d525133f-0431-5d7a-a9ab-6920ba12c37d','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',6,'hit something','به چیزی ضربه بزن','spoken & written','to succeed in hitting someone or something','[ intransitive ]',null,'موفق شدن در زدن کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He swung at the ball, but didn’t connect.","translation":"او به سمت توپ چرخید، اما وصل نشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001102958.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7ee93188-78b5-5ea3-b8e4-00ee7cbce886','a8a45092-24b1-5cb6-a505-89fff16d2159',7,'understand people','مردم را درک کند','spoken & written','if people connect, they feel that they like each other and understand each other','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر مردم ارتباط برقرار کنند، احساس می کنند که یکدیگر را دوست دارند و یکدیگر را درک می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They valued her ability to empathize and connect with others.","translation":"آنها برای توانایی او در همدلی و ارتباط با دیگران ارزش قائل بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675336.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('50de8427-8d83-541e-bacc-768b065dfc55','a98a8dc3-34b8-55bd-8da9-d827d72089ec',1,null,null,'spoken & written','permission to do something',null,'age of consent','رضایت، اجازه؛ هم‌رأیی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give (somebody) your consent The child’s parents have to give their consent to the operation.','have somebody’s consent He claimed to have the consent of the car’s owner.','get somebody’s consent ( also obtain somebody’s consent formal ) Your solicitor will need to obtain your signed consent.','something requires somebody’s consent Your consent is required before we can apply for a medical report.','grant consent formal (= give it formally ) The local council was prepared to grant consent to the project.','refuse (your) consent When the firm applied for consent to build on the site, it was refused.','withhold (your) consent (= not give it ) A patient has the right to withhold consent to treatment.','written consent If you are under 18, you need your parents’ written consent to get married.','verbal consent (= spoken consent ) He gave his verbal consent to have the interview taped.','parental consent (= from someone’s parents ) Students may not be absent from school without parental consent.','somebody’s prior consent (= consent before you do something ) Do not take photographs of people without obtaining their prior consent.','informed consent (= based on full information about what will happen ) The men took part in this study after giving informed consent.','express consent (= consent that is given in a verbal or written way, and not consent that you assume someone gives ) Your medical records will only be released with your express consent.','tacit consent (= one that is not given verbally or in writing, but that you feel someone has given ) If you continue to live in a particular state when it is possible to leave, this implies tacit consent to that state’s political system.','planning consent British English (= consent to build a new building or change an old one ) You will need to apply for planning consent.','the age of consent (= the age at which someone can legally marry or have sex ) She was fifteen, under the age of consent, when she became pregnant.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He took the car without the owner’s consent .","translation":"او بدون رضایت مالک ماشین را گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001103859.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her parents gave their consent to the marriage.","translation":"والدین او رضایت خود را برای ازدواج اعلام کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001939857.mp3"},{"sentence":"A patient can refuse consent for a particular treatment at any time.","translation":"بیمار می تواند در هر زمانی رضایت خود را برای درمان خاصی رد کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845348.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most owners are happy to have their names used for publicity if this is done with their prior consent .","translation":"اگر این کار با رضایت قبلی آنها انجام شود، اکثر مالکان خوشحال هستند که از نام آنها برای تبلیغات استفاده شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845352.mp3"},{"sentence":"Informed consent was obtained from all participants before the study began.","translation":"رضایت آگاهانه از همه شرکت کنندگان قبل از شروع مطالعه اخذ شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845356.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('9566664f-602d-54d1-bc75-4a8e24524723','a98a8dc3-34b8-55bd-8da9-d827d72089ec',2,null,null,'spoken & written','agreement about something',null,null,'توافق در مورد چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give (somebody) your consent The child’s parents have to give their consent to the operation.','have somebody’s consent He claimed to have the consent of the car’s owner.','get somebody’s consent ( also obtain somebody’s consent formal ) Your solicitor will need to obtain your signed consent.','something requires somebody’s consent Your consent is required before we can apply for a medical report.','grant consent formal (= give it formally ) The local council was prepared to grant consent to the project.','refuse (your) consent When the firm applied for consent to build on the site, it was refused.','withhold (your) consent (= not give it ) A patient has the right to withhold consent to treatment.','written consent If you are under 18, you need your parents’ written consent to get married.','verbal consent (= spoken consent ) He gave his verbal consent to have the interview taped.','parental consent (= from someone’s parents ) Students may not be absent from school without parental consent.','somebody’s prior consent (= consent before you do something ) Do not take photographs of people without obtaining their prior consent.','informed consent (= based on full information about what will happen ) The men took part in this study after giving informed consent.','express consent (= consent that is given in a verbal or written way, and not consent that you assume someone gives ) Your medical records will only be released with your express consent.','tacit consent (= one that is not given verbally or in writing, but that you feel someone has given ) If you continue to live in a particular state when it is possible to leave, this implies tacit consent to that state’s political system.','planning consent British English (= consent to build a new building or change an old one ) You will need to apply for planning consent.','the age of consent (= the age at which someone can legally marry or have sex ) She was fifteen, under the age of consent, when she became pregnant.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The chairman was elected by common consent (= with most people agreeing ) .","translation":"رئیس با توافق مشترک (= با موافقت اکثر مردم) انتخاب شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001103873.mp3"},{"sentence":"divorce by mutual consent (= by agreement between both the people involved )","translation":"طلاق با رضایت طرفین (= با توافق بین هر دو نفر)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001103877.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6c2c7e44-5c86-533b-b394-b903343bc176','caa4d5e4-bad5-58b8-8a22-a56a9286f46b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give your permission for something or agree to do something',null,null,'اجازه دادن به شما برای کاری یا موافقت برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her father reluctantly consented to the marriage.","translation":"پدرش با اکراه به ازدواج رضایت داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000856026.mp3"},{"sentence":"He rarely consents to do interviews.","translation":"او به ندرت به انجام مصاحبه رضایت می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675256.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1fc99d87-3dec-5bf6-9a71-ada02132a08e','93549d51-38b2-5664-a024-14a38dab2fba',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to be based on or depend on something',null,'consist in something','بر چیزی مبتنی بودن یا وابسته بودن به آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Happiness does not consist in how many possessions you own.","translation":"خوشبختی به تعداد دارایی شما بستگی ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000856452.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bbbe30a5-befa-581e-a378-3f0e6b8b4126','67226bec-3332-51b2-91ca-1177d0ba0da5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to ask for information or advice from someone because it is their job to know something','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'مشورت کردن، مراجعه کردن به (کارشناس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If symptoms persist, consult a doctor without delay.","translation":"در صورت تداوم علائم، بدون تاخیر با پزشک مشورت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000857266.mp3"},{"sentence":"An increasing number of people are consulting their accountants about the tax laws.","translation":"تعداد فزاینده ای از مردم با حسابداران خود در مورد قوانین مالیاتی مشورت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000857269.mp3"},{"sentence":"I need to consult with my lawyer.","translation":"باید با وکیلم مشورت کنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668190.mp3"},{"sentence":"You need to ask your lawyer.","translation":"باید از وکیل خود بپرسید","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"I think you should go and see your doctor.","translation":"فکر کنم باید بری دکترت رو ببینی","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('d27351f4-1581-5ee6-ae86-f0dcb18699a8','67226bec-3332-51b2-91ca-1177d0ba0da5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to discuss something with someone so that you can make a decision together','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'درباره موضوعی با کسی بحث کنید تا بتوانید با هم تصمیم بگیرید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t believe you sold the car without consulting me!","translation":"باورم نمیشه بدون مشورت با من ماشین رو فروختی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000857273.mp3"},{"sentence":"The president consulted with European leaders before taking action.","translation":"رئیس جمهور قبل از اقدام با رهبران اروپایی مشورت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000857276.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7be5ef23-67b7-5c22-adae-d5f06e557751','67226bec-3332-51b2-91ca-1177d0ba0da5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to look for information in a book, map , list etc','[ transitive ]',null,'برای جستجوی اطلاعات در کتاب، نقشه، فهرست و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Have you consulted a dictionary?","translation":"آیا به دیکشنری مراجعه کرده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000857280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a6756c79-89f0-5356-962c-71847703b467','ca7b6aed-4214-592d-bdb1-6204b4aca797',1,'communication','ارتباط','spoken & written','communication with a person, organization , country etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'تماس، ارتباط؛ شخص آشنا (ویژه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have contact with somebody I haven’t had any contact with her for at least two years.','be in contact (= have regular communication ) He’s been in contact with his lawyer about the situation.','get in contact (= manage to communicate ) Where can I get in contact with you while you are away?','stay/keep in contact ( also maintain contact formal ) We’ve stayed in contact since we met on holiday.','lose contact (= no longer see someone or hear from them ) She moved to Spain and I lost contact with her.','make contact We’d like to make contact with other schools in the area.','put somebody in contact with somebody (= give someone the name, telephone number etc of another person ) I can put you in contact with a friend of mine in Paris.','come into contact with somebody (= meet or spend time with someone ) It’s good to come into contact with people from different cultures.','bring somebody into contact with someone The job brought me into contact with a lot of interesting people.','establish contact The police are trying to establish contact with the kidnappers.','avoid contact She doesn’t give interviews and avoids contact with the media.','sever contact with somebody (= refuse to have any contact with someone ) After the divorce, she severed all contact with her husband.','direct contact (= spending time with someone ) Our volunteers work in direct contact with people who need help.','close contact (= communicating with someone often ) I like to stay in close contact with my parents.','personal contact (= seeing and speaking to someone personally ) She never comes into personal contact with senior managers.','social/human contact (= spending time with other people ) He lived alone and had little human contact.','regular contact All students have regular contact with their tutor.','day-to-day/daily contact I like my job because it involves day-to-day contact with clients.','face-to-face contact (= talking to someone who is with you ) Certain types of jobs do not need face-to-face contact.','one-to-one contact (= being with only one other person ) Children with learning difficulties may need one-to-one contact.','radio contact (= communication by radio ) Air traffic control had lost radio contact with the pilot.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is very little contact between the two tribes.","translation":"ارتباط بین این دو قبیله بسیار کم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106824.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many of us have no direct contact with elderly people.","translation":"بسیاری از ما هیچ ارتباط مستقیمی با افراد مسن نداریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000359.mp3"},{"sentence":"We stay in contact by email.","translation":"ما از طریق ایمیل در تماس هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106827.mp3"},{"sentence":"The town is cut off from contact with the outside world.","translation":"ارتباط شهر با دنیای بیرون قطع شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685800.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c9379057-a9fe-539a-95ea-13cf598f17d5','ca7b6aed-4214-592d-bdb1-6204b4aca797',2,'touch','لمس کنید','spoken & written','when two people or things touch each other','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی دو نفر یا اشیاء یکدیگر را لمس می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have contact with somebody I haven’t had any contact with her for at least two years.','be in contact (= have regular communication ) He’s been in contact with his lawyer about the situation.','get in contact (= manage to communicate ) Where can I get in contact with you while you are away?','stay/keep in contact ( also maintain contact formal ) We’ve stayed in contact since we met on holiday.','lose contact (= no longer see someone or hear from them ) She moved to Spain and I lost contact with her.','make contact We’d like to make contact with other schools in the area.','put somebody in contact with somebody (= give someone the name, telephone number etc of another person ) I can put you in contact with a friend of mine in Paris.','come into contact with somebody (= meet or spend time with someone ) It’s good to come into contact with people from different cultures.','bring somebody into contact with someone The job brought me into contact with a lot of interesting people.','establish contact The police are trying to establish contact with the kidnappers.','avoid contact She doesn’t give interviews and avoids contact with the media.','sever contact with somebody (= refuse to have any contact with someone ) After the divorce, she severed all contact with her husband.','direct contact (= spending time with someone ) Our volunteers work in direct contact with people who need help.','close contact (= communicating with someone often ) I like to stay in close contact with my parents.','personal contact (= seeing and speaking to someone personally ) She never comes into personal contact with senior managers.','social/human contact (= spending time with other people ) He lived alone and had little human contact.','regular contact All students have regular contact with their tutor.','day-to-day/daily contact I like my job because it involves day-to-day contact with clients.','face-to-face contact (= talking to someone who is with you ) Certain types of jobs do not need face-to-face contact.','one-to-one contact (= being with only one other person ) Children with learning difficulties may need one-to-one contact.','radio contact (= communication by radio ) Air traffic control had lost radio contact with the pilot.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Children need physical contact with a caring adult.","translation":"کودکان نیاز به تماس فیزیکی با یک بزرگسال دلسوز دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106844.mp3"},{"sentence":"The disease spreads by sexual contact between infected animals.","translation":"این بیماری از طریق تماس جنسی بین حیوانات آلوده گسترش می یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106847.mp3"},{"sentence":"For a second, his hand was in contact with mine.","translation":"یک لحظه دستش با دستم در تماس بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685813.mp3"},{"sentence":"When water comes into contact with air, carbon dioxide is released.","translation":"هنگامی که آب با هوا تماس پیدا می کند، دی اکسید کربن آزاد می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106853.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bomb exploded on contact (= at the moment it touched something ) .","translation":"بمب در تماس منفجر شد (= در لحظه ای که چیزی را لمس کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001106857.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('9b2ba06c-adc9-54ea-8e53-26e7b1b30e0a','ca7b6aed-4214-592d-bdb1-6204b4aca797',3,'experience','تجربه','spoken & written','when you meet someone or experience a particular kind of thing','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی با کسی ملاقات می کنید یا چیز خاصی را تجربه می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have contact with somebody I haven’t had any contact with her for at least two years.','be in contact (= have regular communication ) He’s been in contact with his lawyer about the situation.','get in contact (= manage to communicate ) Where can I get in contact with you while you are away?','stay/keep in contact ( also maintain contact formal ) We’ve stayed in contact since we met on holiday.','lose contact (= no longer see someone or hear from them ) She moved to Spain and I lost contact with her.','make contact We’d like to make contact with other schools in the area.','put somebody in contact with somebody (= give someone the name, telephone number etc of another person ) I can put you in contact with a friend of mine in Paris.','come into contact with somebody (= meet or spend time with someone ) It’s good to come into contact with people from different cultures.','bring somebody into contact with someone The job brought me into contact with a lot of interesting people.','establish contact The police are trying to establish contact with the kidnappers.','avoid contact She doesn’t give interviews and avoids contact with the media.','sever contact with somebody (= refuse to have any contact with someone ) After the divorce, she severed all contact with her husband.','direct contact (= spending time with someone ) Our volunteers work in direct contact with people who need help.','close contact (= communicating with someone often ) I like to stay in close contact with my parents.','personal contact (= seeing and speaking to someone personally ) She never comes into personal contact with senior managers.','social/human contact (= spending time with other people ) He lived alone and had little human contact.','regular contact All students have regular contact with their tutor.','day-to-day/daily contact I like my job because it involves day-to-day contact with clients.','face-to-face contact (= talking to someone who is with you ) Certain types of jobs do not need face-to-face contact.','one-to-one contact (= being with only one other person ) Children with learning difficulties may need one-to-one contact.','radio contact (= communication by radio ) Air traffic control had lost radio contact with the pilot.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Everyone who came into contact with Di felt better for knowing her.","translation":"همه کسانی که با دی در تماس بودند از شناختن او احساس بهتری داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685823.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pat’s job brings her into contact with the problems people face when they retire.","translation":"شغل پت او را با مشکلاتی که مردم هنگام بازنشستگی با آن مواجه می شوند، در تماس می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685831.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
