eir tutor.','day-to-day/daily contact I like my job because it involves day-to-day contact with clients.','face-to-face contact (= talking to someone who is with you ) Certain types of jobs do not need face-to-face contact.','one-to-one contact (= being with only one other person ) Children with learning difficulties may need one-to-one contact.','radio contact (= communication by radio ) Air traffic control had lost radio contact with the pilot.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
