('28e25bdd-786f-5d7d-b3d9-f8efa3aa4b4d','42c35b4c-0d17-5e5c-97ff-140fdde783e9',2,null,null,'formal','to make someone feel happy and satisfied',null,null,'تا کسی احساس خوشبختی و رضایت کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was no longer satisfied with the life that had hitherto contented me.","translation":"دیگر از زندگی که تا آن زمان مرا راضی کرده بود راضی نبودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859566.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('27503ee5-fe0a-5de2-b94d-3a838429a6aa','e13972bb-a42a-525f-8b0a-98bd12381a85',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a competition or a situation in which two or more people or groups are competing with each other',null,null,'رقابت، مسابقه؛ منازعه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['enter a contest (= take part in one ) Anyone over 18 years old can enter the contest.','take part in a contest Twenty-five countries took part in the contest.','compete in a contest The band has competed in many contests over the years.','win/lose a contest He won a public-speaking contest at his school.','withdraw from a contest (= stop taking part in a contest ) Two candidates had withdrawn from the contest.','have/hold a contest My college holds an athletics contest once a year.','a contest takes place The contest took place in Berlin.','a leadership contest (= in which two politicians compete to become leader of their party ) The party did not want the turmoil of a leadership contest.','a presidential contest the 1987 U.S presidential contest','an electoral/election contest What will be the outcome of the electoral contest?','a beauty contest (= to find the most beautiful person ) Miss Colombia won the beauty contest.','a talent contest (= to find the best performer ) She''s singing a song in the school talent contest.','a popularity contest (= to decide which person people like the most ) The competition has turned into a popularity contest.','close (= one which someone wins by a very small amount ) The race was a close contest between two evenly matched crews.','fair (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) Divide the class into groups in a way that will make it a fair contest.','even/equal British English (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) One of the men was much older so it was hardly an even contest.','uneven/unequal British English (= one in which one of the people, groups etc has a better chance of winning ) Given their military strength, the war was a pretty unequal contest.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the bitter contest for the Republican presidential nomination","translation":"رقابت تلخ برای نامزدی جمهوری خواهان در انتخابات ریاست جمهوری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685568.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stone decided to hold a contest to see who could write the best song.","translation":"استون تصمیم گرفت مسابقه ای برگزار کند تا ببیند چه کسی می تواند بهترین آهنگ را بنویسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001939756.mp3"},{"sentence":"I only entered the contest for fun.","translation":"من فقط برای سرگرمی وارد مسابقه شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859630.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is clear that the election will be a close contest .","translation":"واضح است که انتخابات یک رقابت نزدیک خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000361.mp3"},{"sentence":"the 1960 contest between Kennedy and Nixon","translation":"مسابقه 1960 بین کندی و نیکسون","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002084124.mp3"},{"sentence":"the 1975 Liberal leadership contest","translation":"رقابت رهبری لیبرال در سال 1975","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002084125.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a85ed21f-f38b-50c6-bc03-21d1e797827b','e13972bb-a42a-525f-8b0a-98bd12381a85',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'no contest','رقابت، مسابقه؛ منازعه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['enter a contest (= take part in one ) Anyone over 18 years old can enter the contest.','take part in a contest Twenty-five countries took part in the contest.','compete in a contest The band has competed in many contests over the years.','win/lose a contest He won a public-speaking contest at his school.','withdraw from a contest (= stop taking part in a contest ) Two candidates had withdrawn from the contest.','have/hold a contest My college holds an athletics contest once a year.','a contest takes place The contest took place in Berlin.','a leadership contest (= in which two politicians compete to become leader of their party ) The party did not want the turmoil of a leadership contest.','a presidential contest the 1987 U.S presidential contest','an electoral/election contest What will be the outcome of the electoral contest?','a beauty contest (= to find the most beautiful person ) Miss Colombia won the beauty contest.','a talent contest (= to find the best performer ) She''s singing a song in the school talent contest.','a popularity contest (= to decide which person people like the most ) The competition has turned into a popularity contest.','close (= one which someone wins by a very small amount ) The race was a close contest between two evenly matched crews.','fair (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) Divide the class into groups in a way that will make it a fair contest.','even/equal British English (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) One of the men was much older so it was hardly an even contest.','uneven/unequal British English (= one in which one of the people, groups etc has a better chance of winning ) Given their military strength, the war was a pretty unequal contest.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3683223c-b5d6-5203-926c-b5c24a07a4cd','e13972bb-a42a-525f-8b0a-98bd12381a85',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'plead no contest','رقابت، مسابقه؛ منازعه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['enter a contest (= take part in one ) Anyone over 18 years old can enter the contest.','take part in a contest Twenty-five countries took part in the contest.','compete in a contest The band has competed in many contests over the years.','win/lose a contest He won a public-speaking contest at his school.','withdraw from a contest (= stop taking part in a contest ) Two candidates had withdrawn from the contest.','have/hold a contest My college holds an athletics contest once a year.','a contest takes place The contest took place in Berlin.','a leadership contest (= in which two politicians compete to become leader of their party ) The party did not want the turmoil of a leadership contest.','a presidential contest the 1987 U.S presidential contest','an electoral/election contest What will be the outcome of the electoral contest?','a beauty contest (= to find the most beautiful person ) Miss Colombia won the beauty contest.','a talent contest (= to find the best performer ) She''s singing a song in the school talent contest.','a popularity contest (= to decide which person people like the most ) The competition has turned into a popularity contest.','close (= one which someone wins by a very small amount ) The race was a close contest between two evenly matched crews.','fair (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) Divide the class into groups in a way that will make it a fair contest.','even/equal British English (= one in which everyone has the same chance of winning ) One of the men was much older so it was hardly an even contest.','uneven/unequal British English (= one in which one of the people, groups etc has a better chance of winning ) Given their military strength, the war was a pretty unequal contest.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('76f1f17b-788b-519f-976c-adb8e50efe6b','2203bca5-e221-5459-971d-d3b114901045',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to say formally that you do not accept something or do not agree with it',null,null,'به طور رسمی بگویید که چیزی را قبول ندارید یا با آن موافق نیستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His brothers are contesting the will.","translation":"برادرانش با وصیت نامه مخالفت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859650.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2842517a-4e41-576e-9856-8d073bb85df3','2203bca5-e221-5459-971d-d3b114901045',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to compete for something or to try to win it',null,null,'رقابت برای چیزی یا تلاش برای بردن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His wife is contesting a seat on the council.","translation":"همسرش برای یک کرسی در شورا رقابت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859654.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8ff8d353-2554-5b31-b163-815c615da2b4','06dc36dc-8d4f-5bfb-bbaa-bc8d7c5dece2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the situation, events , or information that are related to something and that help you to understand it',null,null,'بستر (موقعیتی)؛ متن پیش و پس؛ زمینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the social/political/historical etc context You often need to understand the cultural context of jokes.','a wider/broader/larger context (= a more general situation, set of events etc ) It’s important to look at the story in the wider context of medieval Spain.','an international/European/British etc context We study the work of these artists in their European context.','a general context This problem is occurring within a general context of economic difficulty.','see something in the context of something (= consider and understand something in relation to a particular situation ) His life and work must be seen in the context of his youth.','look at/examine etc something in context Although this does not seem to be a good result, let’s examine it in context.','put something in/into context (= consider something in context ) These statistics need to be put into context.','place/set something in context (= consider something in context ) The issue must be placed within its historical context.','provide a context for something The study provides a context for future research.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the political context of the election","translation":"زمینه سیاسی انتخابات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685601.mp3"},{"sentence":"To appreciate what these changes will mean, it is necessary to look at them in context .","translation":"برای درک این که این تغییرات چه معنایی خواهند داشت، لازم است به آنها در زمینه نگاه کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859682.mp3"},{"sentence":"These incidents are best understood in the broader context of developments in rural society.","translation":"این حوادث در بستر وسیع تر تحولات در جامعه روستایی به بهترین وجه قابل درک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685611.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('aeeece12-97db-5378-8535-3bd5b9944e4a','06dc36dc-8d4f-5bfb-bbaa-bc8d7c5dece2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the words that come just before and after a word or sentence and that help you understand its meaning',null,null,'کلماتی که درست قبل و بعد از یک کلمه یا جمله می آیند و به شما در درک معنای آن کمک می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the social/political/historical etc context You often need to understand the cultural context of jokes.','a wider/broader/larger context (= a more general situation, set of events etc ) It’s important to look at the story in the wider context of medieval Spain.','an international/European/British etc context We study the work of these artists in their European context.','a general context This problem is occurring within a general context of economic difficulty.','see something in the context of something (= consider and understand something in relation to a particular situation ) His life and work must be seen in the context of his youth.','look at/examine etc something in context Although this does not seem to be a good result, let’s examine it in context.','put something in/into context (= consider something in context ) These statistics need to be put into context.','place/set something in context (= consider something in context ) The issue must be placed within its historical context.','provide a context for something The study provides a context for future research.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The meaning of ‘mad’ depends on its context.","translation":"معنای «دیوانه» به بافت آن بستگی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859686.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1d7d95c4-c5fb-5ed4-b304-b2df7bda49cb','06dc36dc-8d4f-5bfb-bbaa-bc8d7c5dece2',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'take/quote something out of context','بستر (موقعیتی)؛ متن پیش و پس؛ زمینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the social/political/historical etc context You often need to understand the cultural context of jokes.','a wider/broader/larger context (= a more general situation, set of events etc ) It’s important to look at the story in the wider context of medieval Spain.','an international/European/British etc context We study the work of these artists in their European context.','a general context This problem is occurring within a general context of economic difficulty.','see something in the context of something (= consider and understand something in relation to a particular situation ) His life and work must be seen in the context of his youth.','look at/examine etc something in context Although this does not seem to be a good result, let’s examine it in context.','put something in/into context (= consider something in context ) These statistics need to be put into context.','place/set something in context (= consider something in context ) The issue must be placed within its historical context.','provide a context for something The study provides a context for future research.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('fc578b11-f302-514b-8883-d3df953480a8','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',1,'make somebody/something do what you want','کسی/چیزی را وادار به انجام کاری که شما می خواهید','spoken & written','the ability or power to make someone or something do what you want or make something happen in the way you want','[ uncountable ]',null,'کنترل، مهار؛ سنجاق (نظارت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The disease robs you of muscle control.","translation":"این بیماری کنترل عضلات را از شما سلب می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747442.mp3"},{"sentence":"Babies are born with very little control over their movements.","translation":"نوزادان با کنترل بسیار کمی بر حرکات خود متولد می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109098.mp3"},{"sentence":"Artists like to have some control over where their works are hung in a gallery.","translation":"هنرمندان دوست دارند تا حدودی بر جایی که آثارشان در یک گالری آویزان می شود، کنترل داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109101.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s a good teacher who has control of her class.","translation":"او معلم خوبی است که کنترل کلاس خود را در دست دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747448.mp3"},{"sentence":"Students are encouraged to take control of their own learning, rather than just depending on the teacher.","translation":"دانش آموزان تشویق می شوند تا کنترل یادگیری خود را به دست بگیرند، نه اینکه فقط به معلم وابسته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109125.mp3"},{"sentence":"Excessive drinking can make you lose control of your own life.","translation":"نوشیدن زیاد الکل باعث می شود کنترل زندگی خود را از دست بدهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747464.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Do you need any help?’ ‘No. It’s under control , thanks.’","translation":"«به کمکی نیاز داری؟» «نه. تحت کنترل است، متشکرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747454.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dogs are allowed on the trails if they are kept under control .","translation":"اگر سگها تحت کنترل باشند اجازه حضور در مسیرها را دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109105.mp3"},{"sentence":"The car spun out of control and hit a tree.","translation":"ماشین از کنترل خارج شد و به درخت برخورد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001939889.mp3"},{"sentence":"Flight delays do occur, for reasons that are outside our control .","translation":"به دلایلی که خارج از کنترل ما هستند، تاخیر در پرواز اتفاق می افتد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000364.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('7a6644e0-c85d-5b4a-8d0a-6e8b34cfe0c6','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',2,'power','قدرت','spoken & written','the power to make the decisions about how a country, place, company etc is organized or what it does','[ uncountable ]',null,'قدرت تصمیم گیری در مورد نحوه سازماندهی یک کشور، مکان، شرکت و غیره یا اینکه چه کاری انجام می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The press was freed from political control.","translation":"مطبوعات از کنترل سیاسی رها شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747475.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jordan asked for editorial control of the project.","translation":"جردن خواستار کنترل تحریریه پروژه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747478.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anti-government forces are still in control of the area.","translation":"نیروهای ضد دولتی همچنان کنترل این منطقه را در دست دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747481.mp3"},{"sentence":"By the end of the year, the rebels had control over the northern territories.","translation":"در پایان سال، شورشیان کنترل مناطق شمالی را در اختیار داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109138.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Johnson family has effective control of the company, owning almost 60% of the shares.","translation":"خانواده جانسون کنترل موثری بر شرکت دارند و تقریباً 60 درصد از سهام را در اختیار دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109259.mp3"},{"sentence":"China gained control of the island in 1683.","translation":"چین در سال 1683 کنترل جزیره را به دست آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109142.mp3"},{"sentence":"His son is being trained to take control of the family business.","translation":"پسرش برای به دست گرفتن کنترل کسب و کار خانوادگی آموزش می بیند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747493.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Democrats lost control of Congress in the last election.","translation":"دموکرات ها در انتخابات گذشته کنترل کنگره را از دست دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109146.mp3"},{"sentence":"The college was under the control of a group of trustees.","translation":"دانشکده تحت کنترل گروهی از معتمدین بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109267.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole of this area came under Soviet control after World War II.","translation":"کل این منطقه پس از جنگ جهانی دوم تحت کنترل شوروی قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109149.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Conservatives are hoping to regain control of the city council.","translation":"محافظه کاران امیدوارند کنترل شورای شهر را دوباره به دست بگیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109160.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('b8236813-4ef0-5521-b672-b01057d42b1a','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',3,'way of limiting something','راه محدود کردن چیزی','spoken & written','an action, method , or law that limits the amount or growth of something, especially something that is dangerous','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'عمل، روش یا قانونی که مقدار یا رشد چیزی را محدود می کند، به ویژه چیزی که خطرناک است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"pest control","translation":"کنترل آفات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747511.mp3"},{"sentence":"the control of inflation","translation":"کنترل تورم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109176.mp3"},{"sentence":"The authorities imposed strict controls on the movement of cattle.","translation":"مقامات کنترل شدیدی را بر جابجایی احشام اعمال کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109180.mp3"},{"sentence":"an agreement on arms control (= control of the amount of weapons a country has )","translation":"توافقنامه در مورد کنترل تسلیحات (= کنترل مقدار سلاح های یک کشور)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109184.mp3"},{"sentence":"Firefighters had the blaze under control by 9:44 p.m.","translation":"آتش نشانان در ساعت 21:44 آتش را مهار کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109203.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shea used diet and exercise to bring her weight under control .","translation":"شی از رژیم غذایی و ورزش برای کنترل وزن خود استفاده کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747523.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Federal Reserve Bank raised interest rates to keep inflation under control .","translation":"بانک فدرال رزرو برای کنترل تورم نرخ بهره را افزایش داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747529.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rent controls ensured that no one paid too much for housing.","translation":"کنترل اجاره بها تضمین کرد که هیچ کس هزینه زیادی برای مسکن پرداخت نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109194.mp3"},{"sentence":"the introduction of tighter controls on immigration","translation":"اعمال کنترل های شدیدتر بر مهاجرت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109191.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police used fire hoses and dogs for crowd control .","translation":"پلیس برای کنترل جمعیت از شلنگ های آتش نشانی و سگ ها استفاده کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109187.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('fb25e560-1891-5d4e-814d-f4321815d47f','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',4,'ability to stay calm','توانایی آرام ماندن','spoken & written','the ability to remain calm even when you feel very angry, upset, or excited','[ uncountable ]',null,'توانایی حفظ آرامش حتی زمانی که بسیار عصبانی، ناراحت یا هیجان زده هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There were sudden tears in his eyes and he paused, fighting for control.","translation":"ناگهان اشک در چشمانش حلقه زد و مکث کرد و برای کنترل مبارزه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109216.mp3"},{"sentence":"Davidson lost control of himself and started yelling.","translation":"دیویدسون کنترل خود را از دست داد و شروع به داد و فریاد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109220.mp3"},{"sentence":"Small children can’t be expected to have the same self-control (= ability to control their emotions and behaviour ) as an adult.","translation":"نمی توان انتظار داشت که کودکان کوچک مانند بزرگسالان خودکنترلی (= توانایی کنترل احساسات و رفتارشان) را داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747542.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her voice is under control, but she is almost shaking with anger.","translation":"صدایش تحت کنترل است، اما از عصبانیت تقریباً می لرزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747549.mp3"},{"sentence":"I felt calm and in control.","translation":"احساس آرامش و کنترل می کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109239.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('221447b0-c961-5173-8709-9e44c7dc363d','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',5,'machine/vehicle','ماشین / وسیله نقلیه','spoken & written','the thing that you press or turn to make a machine, vehicle, television etc work','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که فشار می دهید یا می چرخانید تا ماشین، وسیله نقلیه، تلویزیون و غیره کار کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the TV remote control","translation":"کنترل از راه دور تلویزیون","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109275.mp3"},{"sentence":"the volume control on the radio","translation":"کنترل صدا در رادیو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109276.mp3"},{"sentence":"a car with manual controls","translation":"ماشینی با کنترل دستی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747553.mp3"},{"sentence":"Belton, at the controls, made a perfect landing.","translation":"بلتون، در کنترل، یک فرود عالی انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('bda99f5a-f0bc-5614-abe0-67a407861a78','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',6,'people who organize an activity','افرادی که یک فعالیت را سازماندهی می کنند','spoken & written','the people who direct an activity or who check that something is done correctly, the place where this is done, or the process of doing it','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'افرادی که یک فعالیت را هدایت می کنند یا بررسی می کنند که آیا کاری به درستی انجام شده است، مکانی که در آن انجام می شود یا روند انجام آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"air-traffic control","translation":"کنترل ترافیک هوایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000552652.mp3"},{"sentence":"Please stop at passport control.","translation":"لطفا در کنترل گذرنامه توقف کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109343.mp3"},{"sentence":"computers used for stock control","translation":"کامپیوترهای مورد استفاده برای کنترل سهام","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109344.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5ce5d0b1-b9be-5161-9377-a91ac0392091','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',7,'scientific test','آزمون علمی','spoken & written','a person, group etc against which you compare another person or group that is very similar, in order to see if a particular quality is caused by something or happens by chance','[ countable ]','controlled experiment','یک فرد، گروه و غیره که شما شخص یا گروه دیگری را که بسیار شبیه به هم هستند با آن مقایسه می کنید تا ببینید آیا کیفیت خاصی ناشی از چیزی است یا تصادفی رخ داده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A control group of non-smoking women was compared to four groups of women smokers.","translation":"یک گروه کنترل از زنان غیر سیگاری با چهار گروه از زنان سیگاری مقایسه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040012.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1852ac07-8baf-57ae-8068-794bc0779c29','0315b422-3e0c-59bd-98b9-b685330f21b2',8,'computer','کامپیوتر','spoken & written','a particular button on a computer that allows you to do certain operations','[ singular ]',null,'یک دکمه خاص در رایانه که به شما امکان می دهد عملیات خاصی را انجام دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Press control and F2 to exit.","translation":"برای خروج، کنترل و F2 را فشار دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109331.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f3d2b6ca-8a0c-5560-943c-2267167f6193','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',1,'power','قدرت','spoken & written','to have the power to make the decisions about how a country, place, company etc is organized or what it does',null,null,'کنترل کردن، مهار کردن؛ نظارت داشتن بر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Democrats continued to control the Senate until last year.","translation":"دموکرات ها تا سال گذشته به کنترل سنا ادامه دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109392.mp3"},{"sentence":"a huge company controlling half the world’s coffee trade","translation":"یک شرکت بزرگ که نیمی از تجارت قهوه در جهان را کنترل می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109371.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d1528f74-6059-538c-8aae-3412e7a16621','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',2,'limit','محدود کردن','spoken & written','to limit the amount or growth of something, especially something that is dangerous',null,null,'محدود کردن مقدار یا رشد چیزی، به ویژه چیزی که خطرناک است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a chemical used to control weeds","translation":"یک ماده شیمیایی که برای کنترل علف های هرز استفاده می شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747562.mp3"},{"sentence":"an economic plan to control inflation","translation":"یک طرح اقتصادی برای کنترل تورم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109401.mp3"},{"sentence":"Development in areas of outstanding natural beauty is strictly controlled.","translation":"توسعه در مناطق با زیبایی طبیعی برجسته به شدت کنترل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109386.mp3"},{"sentence":"Strict measures were taken to control the spread of foot and mouth disease.","translation":"اقدامات سختگیرانه برای کنترل شیوع بیماری تب برفکی انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109423.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('34dfab14-4097-50bf-bb07-0cdcb319f24d','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',3,'make somebody/something do what you want','کسی/چیزی را وادار به انجام کاری که شما می خواهید','spoken & written','to make someone or something do what you want, or make something happen in the way that you want',null,null,'برای اینکه کسی یا چیزی را وادار کنید آنچه را که شما می خواهید انجام دهد یا کاری را انجام دهید که شما می خواهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police had to be called in to control the crowds.","translation":"باید پلیس برای کنترل جمعیت فراخوانده می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109370.mp3"},{"sentence":"a skilled rider controlling a spirited horse","translation":"سوارکاری ماهر که یک اسب با روحیه را کنترل می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747564.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4545b6f5-eeea-5990-9cbb-0dfb7e5e5599','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',4,'emotion','احساس','spoken & written','if you control your emotions, your voice, your expression etc, you succeed in behaving calmly and sensibly, even though you feel angry, upset, or excited',null,null,'اگر احساسات، صدا، بیان خود و غیره را کنترل کنید، موفق می شوید با آرامش و معقول رفتار کنید، حتی اگر احساس عصبانیت، ناراحتی یا هیجان می کنید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sarah took a deep breath, trying to control her anger.","translation":"سارا نفس عمیقی کشید و سعی کرد عصبانیتش را کنترل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109407.mp3"},{"sentence":"He controlled the urge to laugh.","translation":"میل به خندیدن را کنترل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747567.mp3"},{"sentence":"Newman controlled himself with an effort.","translation":"نیومن با تلاش خود را کنترل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109411.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('56efd57c-a75f-55e4-a708-fed4a846aee1','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',5,'machine/process/system','ماشین/فرآیند/سیستم','spoken & written','to make a machine, process, or system work in a particular way',null,null,'تا یک ماشین، فرآیند یا سیستم به روشی خاص کار کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a radio-controlled toy car","translation":"ماشین اسباب بازی رادیویی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628346.mp3"},{"sentence":"A thermostat controls the temperature in the building.","translation":"یک ترموستات دمای ساختمان را کنترل می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109377.mp3"},{"sentence":"The valves in the heart control how quickly the blood is pumped around the body.","translation":"دریچه های قلب کنترل سرعت پمپاژ خون در بدن را بر عهده دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109380.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('93d8ed29-33ca-5bf4-ac80-095cd4cbcee2','d7ea21e9-ef66-5b06-bb52-fb7e0d5edb7b',6,'check something','چیزی را بررسی کنید','spoken & written','to make sure that something is done correctly',null,null,'تا مطمئن شوید که کاری به درستی انجام شده است',array['check','monitor']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company strictly controls the quality of its products.","translation":"این شرکت به شدت کیفیت محصولات خود را کنترل می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001109429.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4de90417-745a-577d-ae72-278ce1e1c26f','c350c495-ca9e-5999-bbbb-157d72d900c3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to change something into a different form, or to change something so that it can be used for a different purpose or in a different way','[ transitive ]',null,'تبدیل کردن، تبدیل کردن (دین، واحد)؛ تغییر کاربری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They converted the spare bedroom into an office.","translation":"آنها اتاق خواب اضافی را به یک دفتر تبدیل کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000861382.mp3"},{"sentence":"The stocks can be easily converted to cash.","translation":"سهام را می توان به راحتی به پول نقد تبدیل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747355.mp3"},{"sentence":"a 19th-century converted barn (= barn changed into a house )","translation":"انبار تبدیل شده قرن نوزدهمی (= انبار تبدیل به خانه)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000861386.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sofa that converts into a bed","translation":"مبل که به تخت تبدیل می شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989812.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the process, the light energy converts to heat energy.","translation":"در این فرآیند، انرژی نور به انرژی گرمایی تبدیل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989813.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('ca0c9bba-14a8-54ba-887e-ac917c9e00d1','c350c495-ca9e-5999-bbbb-157d72d900c3',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to persuade someone to change to a different religion','[ transitive ]',null,'متقاعد کردن کسی برای تغییر به دین دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"European missionaries converted thousands to Christianity.","translation":"مبلغان اروپایی هزاران نفر را به مسیحیت گرویدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989820.mp3"},{"sentence":"She converted to Catholicism.","translation":"او به کاتولیک گروید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989826.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b1a4b759-a929-5c21-ac87-2016674c991f','c350c495-ca9e-5999-bbbb-157d72d900c3',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to change to a different set of ideas, principles , or ways of doing something','[ intransitive ]',null,'تغییر به مجموعه ای متفاوت از ایده ها، اصول یا روش های انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"people who have recently converted to vegetarianism","translation":"افرادی که اخیراً به گیاهخواری روی آورده اند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989833.mp3"},{"sentence":"She succeeded in converting me to her point of view.","translation":"او موفق شد مرا به دیدگاه خود تبدیل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989839.mp3"},{"sentence":"newly converted feminists","translation":"فمینیست های تازه مسلمان شده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989842.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5119f171-9155-5d7c-92d5-070823e6e747','c350c495-ca9e-5999-bbbb-157d72d900c3',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a conversion in rugby or American football','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای ایجاد تغییر در راگبی یا فوتبال آمریکایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3354f92f-40ac-5e26-88e4-887e69ffc5f8','4b6d2b16-5cd9-56ff-80b8-23e74f770953',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who has been persuaded to change their beliefs and accept a particular religion or opinion',null,null,'کسی که متقاعد شده است که باورهای خود را تغییر دهد و دین یا عقیده خاصی را بپذیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a convert to Christianity","translation":"یک گرویده به مسیحیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000862089.mp3"},{"sentence":"recent converts to the cause","translation":"تبدیل های اخیر به علت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001989851.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ac8c93f6-f5ec-5535-966f-277ecc82d46d','cb546912-b298-5ed9-80f2-4680d075f8a9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','having no mistakes',null,null,'درست، صحیح؛ مقتضی',array['right']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a correct answer Lucy got fourteen out of twenty correct answers.','a correct entry (= correct answer in a competition ) The first five correct entries will win £50.','correct information I’m not sure that I’ve been given the correct information.','correct spelling (= the correct way of writing words ) Copying does not teach correct spelling.','correct pronunciation (= the correct way of saying words ) The dictionary will help you learn the correct pronunciation.','absolutely/perfectly/entirely correct (= completely correct ) What he said was perfectly correct.','not strictly correct (= not correct according to some standards ) The grammar in this sentence is not strictly correct.','grammatically correct (= written or spoken with correct grammar ) Simple sentences are more likely to be grammatically correct than long complex ones.','factually correct (= having all the correct facts ) Articles in the newspaper are not always factually correct.','broadly/essentially correct (= correct in most ways, but possibly not all ) All the evidence suggests that the results of his research are essentially correct.','prove correct (= be shown to be true ) Fortunately, my memory proved correct.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"If my calculations are correct, we’re about ten miles from Exeter.","translation":"اگر محاسبات من درست باشد، ما حدود ده مایل با اکستر فاصله داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000369.mp3"},{"sentence":"Score one point for each correct answer .","translation":"برای هر پاسخ صحیح یک امتیاز بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000840671.mp3"},{"sentence":"You are absolutely correct, the Missouri is the longest river in the US.","translation":"کاملاً درست می گویید، میسوری طولانی ترین رودخانه ایالات متحده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711342.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sentence is grammatically correct, but doesn’t sound natural.","translation":"جمله از نظر گرامری صحیح است، اما طبیعی به نظر نمی رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711345.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you sure you’ve got the right address?","translation":"آیا مطمئن هستید که آدرس درستی دارید؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('c699291d-96cc-5b9b-92ea-4c3fff22c3d4','cb546912-b298-5ed9-80f2-4680d075f8a9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','suitable and right for a particular situation',null,null,'مناسب و مناسب برای یک موقعیت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a correct answer Lucy got fourteen out of twenty correct answers.','a correct entry (= correct answer in a competition ) The first five correct entries will win £50.','correct information I’m not sure that I’ve been given the correct information.','correct spelling (= the correct way of writing words ) Copying does not teach correct spelling.','correct pronunciation (= the correct way of saying words ) The dictionary will help you learn the correct pronunciation.','absolutely/perfectly/entirely correct (= completely correct ) What he said was perfectly correct.','not strictly correct (= not correct according to some standards ) The grammar in this sentence is not strictly correct.','grammatically correct (= written or spoken with correct grammar ) Simple sentences are more likely to be grammatically correct than long complex ones.','factually correct (= having all the correct facts ) Articles in the newspaper are not always factually correct.','broadly/essentially correct (= correct in most ways, but possibly not all ) All the evidence suggests that the results of his research are essentially correct.','prove correct (= be shown to be true ) Fortunately, my memory proved correct.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s the correct procedure in cases like this?","translation":"روش صحیح در مواردی از این دست چیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000840676.mp3"},{"sentence":"The correct way to lift heavy weights is to make sure that your back is straight.","translation":"روش صحیح بلند کردن وزنه های سنگین این است که از صاف بودن کمر خود مطمئن شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040013.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('18c6dbf7-2b0f-5c57-9e7c-db248bd75b4d','cb546912-b298-5ed9-80f2-4680d075f8a9',3,null,null,'spoken & written','correct behaviour is formal and polite',null,null,'رفتار صحیح رسمی و مودبانه است',array['proper']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a correct answer Lucy got fourteen out of twenty correct answers.','a correct entry (= correct answer in a competition ) The first five correct entries will win £50.','correct information I’m not sure that I’ve been given the correct information.','correct spelling (= the correct way of writing words ) Copying does not teach correct spelling.','correct pronunciation (= the correct way of saying words ) The dictionary will help you learn the correct pronunciation.','absolutely/perfectly/entirely correct (= completely correct ) What he said was perfectly correct.','not strictly correct (= not correct according to some standards ) The grammar in this sentence is not strictly correct.','grammatically correct (= written or spoken with correct grammar ) Simple sentences are more likely to be grammatically correct than long complex ones.','factually correct (= having all the correct facts ) Articles in the newspaper are not always factually correct.','broadly/essentially correct (= correct in most ways, but possibly not all ) All the evidence suggests that the results of his research are essentially correct.','prove correct (= be shown to be true ) Fortunately, my memory proved correct.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was not considered correct for young ladies to go out on their own.","translation":"این که خانم های جوان به تنهایی بیرون بروند صحیح تلقی نمی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000840681.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1103abaa-938c-540b-ad0d-47958afcdcd8','448be203-6684-593d-ad80-7183afc0e201',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make something right or to make it work the way it should',null,null,'اصلاح کردن، درست کردن؛ رفع اشکال کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some eyesight problems are relatively easy to correct.","translation":"اصلاح برخی از مشکلات بینایی نسبتاً آسان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111556.mp3"},{"sentence":"You have the right to see a copy of your file, and to correct any mistakes you may find.","translation":"شما این حق را دارید که یک نسخه از فایل خود را ببینید و هر گونه اشتباهی را که ممکن است پیدا کنید اصلاح کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711588.mp3"},{"sentence":"The problem should be fairly easy to put right .","translation":"رفع مشکل باید نسبتاً آسان باشد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('8f4efea2-1415-5648-a7f8-f95feadf268b','448be203-6684-593d-ad80-7183afc0e201',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to show someone that something is wrong , and make it right',null,null,'به کسی نشان دادن که چیزی اشتباه است و درست کردنش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Correct my pronunciation if it’s wrong.","translation":"اگر اشتباه است تلفظ من را تصحیح کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111545.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘She’s in Ireland now.’ ‘She was, ’ Farrell corrected him.","translation":"«او اکنون در ایرلند است.» فارل او را تصحیح کرد: «او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711589.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I, ’ Lady Deverill corrected herself, ‘we are very happy here.’","translation":"لیدی دووریل خودش را اصلاح کرد: «من اینجا خیلی خوشحالیم.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001711592.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('61ecaca2-e4f1-5f8b-9e98-308b19ae8977','448be203-6684-593d-ad80-7183afc0e201',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if a teacher corrects a student’s written work, he or she writes marks on it to show the mistakes in it',null,null,'اگر معلم کار نوشته شده دانش آموزی را تصحیح کند، روی آن علامت می نویسد تا اشتباهات آن را نشان دهد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
