('893f37d6-045b-57af-9a55-52378d276367','cec96204-02fb-59b6-b290-9a0f34c3c9bc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a continuous movement of water in a river , lake , or sea',null,null,'جریان (آب، هوا، برق)؛ روند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an ocean/sea/river current Ocean currents carry young fish out to sea.','a tidal current (= caused by the movement of the tides ) Tidal currents make the seas around the islands very rough.','strong On surfing beaches, strong currents are common.','fast/fast-flowing Fast-flowing currents made the rescue job even harder.','dangerous/treacherous Beaches usually have signs that warn of dangerous currents.','a current flows Sea currents flow at up to 12 miles per hour around parts of the coast.','a current carries somebody/something (= makes them move along in the water ) Their boat was moving fast, carried by the current.','a current sweeps somebody/something (= carries them very powerfully, so that they cannot stop moving ) The treacherous currents have swept away three swimmers in the past year.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Strong currents can be very dangerous for swimmers.","translation":"جریان های قوی می تواند برای شناگران بسیار خطرناک باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692422.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
