('2bd83b11-0b6f-5765-b6bb-c167b92c0c2c','68cfb3db-6441-5263-8fd8-88e55a277ff1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that something happens or is true even though something else might have prevented it',null,null,'با وجودِ، فارغ ازِ (تضاد با انتظار)',array['in spite of']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Despite all our efforts to save the school, the authorities decided to close it.","translation":"با وجود تمام تلاش‌های ما برای نجات مدرسه، مسئولان تصمیم به تعطیلی آن گرفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000820030.mp3"},{"sentence":"She went to Spain despite the fact that her doctor had told her to rest.","translation":"علیرغم اینکه پزشکش به او گفته بود استراحت کند به اسپانیا رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000820033.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('09c48694-36cd-5085-998b-383b737a9752','68cfb3db-6441-5263-8fd8-88e55a277ff1',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'despite yourself','با وجودِ، فارغ ازِ (تضاد با انتظار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b5d45fac-f886-5110-b7aa-ef0d1c505748','d6022416-6c6b-5307-8cf4-b5ab4571a62f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to damage something so badly that it no longer exists or cannot be used or repaired',null,null,'نابود کردن، برچیدن؛ خمیری کردن (امید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['destroy the evidence (= deliberately destroy evidence of a crime ) They set light to the car to destroy the evidence.','destroy the environment Some of these companies are polluting and destroying the environment.','destroy the world/planet No one wants another war, which might destroy the world.','destroy somebody’s career She made one bad mistake and it destroyed her career.','destroy somebody’s reputation The scandal destroyed his reputation.','destroy the character of something New buildings have destroyed much of the character of the area.','destroy somebody’s hopes Losing the game destroyed the team’s hopes of reaching the semi-finals.','destroy somebody’s confidence When he failed his degree, it completely destroyed his confidence.','completely/totally destroy something The plane was completely destroyed when it hit a mountain.','partially destroy something The Great Fire of 1666 partially destroyed the prison.','be destroyed by fire/a bomb/earthquake etc The building was destroyed by fire in 2004.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The school was completely destroyed by fire.","translation":"مدرسه بر اثر آتش سوزی به طور کامل تخریب شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716208.mp3"},{"sentence":"companies that are polluting and destroying the environment","translation":"شرکت هایی که محیط زیست را آلوده و تخریب می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830531.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
